                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[CT3] Entity-Relative Operational Progression" id="id-873bd8a6758955b996c204275d26ed4f">
                  <documentation>Coordinate serial, entity-relative operational inputs and their interested behaviours.

**Overview**

Patient, practitioner and bed concerns recur across different business contexts; each can need a coherent progression frame without one central entity service.

**Intent**

Maintain a coherent operational reference frame as one entity reacts to successive inputs.

**Boundary**

Interest fan-out is distinct from intra-entity concurrency; entity progression does not acquire originating facts.</documentation>
