              <folder name="II.1.1.1.1.2 [CT3] Governed Activity Execution Control" id="id-38c71af9eee8483a9763a33f6a8747a9">
                <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.1.1.1.2. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=1e351cdfdc1045e384c3bd768eed8e80; Exchange identifier=id-dfb644fa99745553bf0ff980faf30c6d. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[CT3] Governed Activity Execution Control" id="id-dfb644fa99745553bf0ff980faf30c6d">
                  <documentation>Instantiate, dispatch, supervise and progress authorised operational undertakings with explicit outcome standing.

**Overview**

Reusable execution control respects work-unit archetype, participation and uncertain effects rather than equating dispatch with completion.

**Intent**

Progress accountable operational work without equating dispatch, execution and successful outcome.

**Boundary**

Does not own underlying clinical-work meaning, clinical decisions or originator business authority.</documentation>
