            <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[CT1] Coordinated Activity &amp; Interaction" id="id-6d2882efaa7756e886bb64a9ca045885">
              <documentation>Enable governed interaction, event participation, boundary exchange and accountable activity progression.

**Overview**

Requests, events, work and human interaction are related ways to cause or observe change, with distinct contracts and progression responsibilities.

**Intent**

Make requests, event participation, work and human interaction progress according to their different contracts.

**Boundary**

Exchange is not execution, notification is not outcome, and interaction is not clinical authority.</documentation>
