                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[CT3] Active Information Availability" id="id-50306e15812e5ba3aa26482f2c9c84ac">
                  <documentation>Maintain responsive, reconstructable active information and coordinate its safe use.

**Overview**

Active representation, observation and convergence support availability while preserving an explicit trust basis for use.

**Intent**

Provide responsive managed use without promoting active representation into durable truth.

**Boundary**

An active generation is not an authoritative version; failure to converge does not establish valid active state.</documentation>
