tter isolation.\n\n\n\n\\item \nEmitting platform telemetry, operational health metrics, and queue processing metrics.\n\n\n\n\\end{itemize}\n\n\n\\item \n\\textbf{Collaborative Nature}: Realized collaboratively across boundary gateways, messaging infrastructure, execution workers, and storage layers.\n\n\n\n\\end{itemize}\n\\subsubsection*{EC-12 /\\allowbreak{} EC-14 Boundary}\n\nEC-12 retains the established scope and responsibilities above. It may contribute directly to generic operational/\\allowbreak{}processing assurance, limited to that contribution in the \\href{https://github.com/fhirfactory/harmonia/blob/98410db60155198a75f74c79d98060070209faa1/docs/markdown/02-strategy/capability-maps/health-service-assurance-derivation.md\\#collaborative-enterprise-capability-contribution-matrix}{approved assurance matrix}. It does not own the general semantics of assurance disposition, assurance-specific criteria applicability, evidentiary association, assessment against assurance criteria, adjudication, or independent assurance findings and conclusions. Those distinguishing responsibilities are introduced through EC-14 Service Guardian. Operational health and business-level processing assurance remain distinct; EC-12 is not expanded to absorb EC-14.\n\n&quot;,&quot;id_aliases&quot;:[&quot;EC-12&quot;],&quot;key&quot;:&quot;enterprise:ec-12&quot;,&quot;latex_label&quot;:&quot;cap:ec-12&quot;,&quot;local_id&quot;:&quot;EC-12&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Operational Assurance&quot;,&quot;name_aliases&quot;:[],&quot;name_status&quot;:&quot;Canonical&quot;,&quot;owner_identifier&quot;:null,&quot;owner_key&quot;:null,&quot;parent_identifier&quot;:&quot;HCM-EC-trust-accountability-assurance&quot;,&quot;parent_key&quot;:&quot;proposal:ec-trust-accountability-assurance&quot;,&quot;placement_provenance&quot;:{&quot;authority&quot;:&quot;Proposed only; cited source standing is not inherited&quot;,&quot;derivation&quot;:&quot;Responsibility-preserving proposed decomposition&quot;,&quot;evidence&quot;:[{&quot;line&quot;:49,&quot;path&quot;:&quot;docs/markdown/03-business-architecture/metamodel/business-architecture-metamodel.md&quot;,&quot;standing&quot;:&quot;Current corpus evidence; does not promote the derived assertion&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Harmonia SHALL use the fixed three-tier Capability decomposition:&quot;},{&quot;line&quot;:668,&quot;path&quot;:&quot;docs/markdown/governance/architectural-axioms.md&quot;,&quot;standing&quot;:&quot;Current corpus evidence; does not promote the derived assertion&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;### AX-14 — Semantic Distinctions Are Preserved&quot;}],&quot;method&quot;:&quot;AI architectural synthesis under the explicitly authorised Step 2 task&quot;},&quot;placement_rationale&quot;:&quot;The established reusable responsibility is a constituent ability of Trust, Accountability &amp; Assurance; its canonical scope and exclusions remain unchanged.&quot;,&quot;placement_status&quot;:&quot;Proposed&quot;,&quot;record_state&quot;:&quot;current&quot;,&quot;reference_id&quot;:&quot;EC-12&quot;,&quot;responsibility_owner_key&quot;:null,&quot;source_rad_documents&quot;:[&quot;docs/markdown/02-strategy/capabilities/enterprise-capabilities.md&quot;],&quot;sources&quot;:[{&quot;anchor&quot;:&quot;ec-12-operational-assurance&quot;,&quot;line&quot;:202,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;enterprise&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;### EC-12: Operational Assurance&quot;}],&quot;structural_id_status&quot;:&quot;Proposed&quot;,&quot;tier&quot;:&quot;CT2&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;enterprise_capability&quot;,&quot;unresolved&quot;:[],&quot;views&quot;:[]}"/>
