                <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.1.3.3.1. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=7eca9fc4d2244b0facc83376e57ebbc4; Exchange identifier=id-0331dca5104b504794a216037ed9bd40. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[CT3] Operation Policy Resolution" id="id-0331dca5104b504794a216037ed9bd40">
                  <documentation>Resolve effective, temporally applicable permission criteria for an established identity and governed operation.

**Overview**

Permission depends on controlled criteria, role assignments, action and information scope; revocation is distinct from natural expiry.

**Intent**

Determine the effective permitted action under the applicable identity, information and temporal criteria.

**Boundary**

Does not authenticate identity or grant permission from caller-controlled tags or mere role names.</documentation>
