;,&quot;line&quot;:66,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;assurance-strategy&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;| [EC-07 Provenance &amp; Traceability](../capabilities/enterprise-capabilities.md#ec-07-provenance--traceability) | Supporting | Supporting | Direct |&quot;}],&quot;status&quot;:&quot;established&quot;,&quot;to&quot;:&quot;enterprise:ec-07&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;enterprise_contribution&quot;},&quot;source_index&quot;:929}]"/>
