            <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[CT1] Trust, Accountability &amp; Assurance" id="id-9c7d1cf0966a5d1bb0c17707051a793e">
              <documentation>Make governed activity permissible, attributable, operationally dependable and independently assessable.

**Overview**

Policy, evidence, resilience and independent assurance contribute to confidence through different responsibilities. Keeping them as peers prevents technical success or recorded evidence from becoming a business assurance conclusion.

**Intent**

Keep permission, attribution, operational integrity and independent confidence distinguishable and usable together.

**Boundary**

Cross-cutting participation does not distribute semantic ownership, mandate centralisation or authorise the assured subject to determine its own conclusion.</documentation>
