              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[CT2] Service Delivery Preparedness Management" id="id-5abfc42605a55d9da4808dc3b3688708">
                <documentation>Establish whether service offerings can be delivered in their intended operating contexts through the combined standing of their dependencies.

**Overview**

Preparedness asks whether the service as a whole can operate, distinct from scheduling capacity or readiness of a single place. This is a proposed missing business frame for the already identified readiness concern.

**Intent**

Recognise whether the whole service can actually operate in its intended context.

**Boundary**

Does not own the dependencies, their management or clinical execution.</documentation>
