              <folder name="II.1.2.5.1.4 [CT3] IT Infrastructure Management" id="id-6aad9f977436429294434272a64c3b8c">
                <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.2.5.1.4. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=9a37413582314e0dbac006f82900858b; Exchange identifier=id-bf24089b93df5112a20cb5016d9190cc. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[CT3] IT Infrastructure Management" id="id-bf24089b93df5112a20cb5016d9190cc">
                  <documentation>Operate/manage underlying technology infrastructure and its availability.

IT Infrastructure Management operates the underlying technology infrastructure and its availability. It supplies an enterprise support context for health-service activity that relies on functioning technology. Its business outcome is operational infrastructure, distinct from governance of health-information meaning or the application responsibilities realised on that infrastructure.

**Boundary**

Infrastructure machinery does not define Harmonia's information semantics or acquire clinical authority.</documentation>
