              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[CT2] Financial &amp; Commercial Services" id="id-d8bd52f72b215fa795b82e4319a9b5bb">
                <documentation>Provide the financial/commercial business context materially required for R1/R2.

Financial &amp; Commercial Services provides the financial business frame needed for the bounded R1/R2 responsibility. Its established child identifies and supplies information about chargeable or cost-relevant clinical activity. The purpose is to make applicable activity evidence available to the responsible financial context without expanding the model into pricing, claims or revenue management.

**Intent**

Support legitimate funding, financial and charging purposes with relevant clinical-activity information.

**Boundary**

Not every exchanged request or activity is chargeable. Provision of evidence does not establish a charging decision or an enterprise financial system.

## Qualified relationship assertions

Original source predicates, evidence and qualifications remain in the metadata. The ARB has now adjudicated their native treatment; explicitly unestablished relationship existence remains excluded. Native representation does not promote source standing.

