              <folder name="II.1.2.6.1.4 [CT3] Diagnostic Report Management" id="id-cbd6860fa17648e194b8ad224393aaae">
                <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.2.6.1.4. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=977ed170c34445ddb5095945f54f6907; Exchange identifier=id-590de53fba7f53b18766b507fe3952df. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[CT3] Diagnostic Report Management" id="id-590de53fba7f53b18766b507fe3952df">
                  <documentation>Establish and govern the authoritative expression of diagnostic findings, including applicable creation, review, amendment, verification, finalisation and authorisation/signing.

Diagnostic Report Management governs the authoritative expression of diagnostic findings. Creation, review, verification, amendment, finalisation and signing matter because they establish the standing of the report rather than merely its existence as data. The responsibility preserves a meaningful distinction between evidence, interpretation and the report that a service is prepared to authorise.

**Boundary**

Signing is behaviour within this capability, not another CT3. Sending a report does not establish its authorisation.</documentation>
                  <property key="v0.2 / Source Capture Key" value="business-capability:diagnostic-report-management"/>
                  <property key="v0.2 / Snapshot Reference ID" value="HCM-BC-diagnostic-report-management"/>
                  <property key="v0.2 / LaTeX Label" value="cap:bc-diagnostic-report-management"/>
                  <property key="v0.2 / Construct Type" value="capability"/>
                  <property key="v0.2 / Capability Tier" value="CT3"/>
