                  <property key="v0.2 / Snapshot Record JSON" value="{&quot;ancestry_status&quot;:&quot;established&quot;,&quot;architectural_status&quot;:&quot;Canonical&quot;,&quot;baseline_description&quot;:{&quot;Boundary&quot;:&quot;Signing is behaviour within this capability, not another CT3. Sending a report does not establish its authorisation.&quot;,&quot;Capability Overview&quot;:&quot;Diagnostic Report Management governs the authoritative expression of diagnostic findings. Creation, review, verification, amendment, finalisation and signing matter because they establish the standing of the report rather than merely its existence as data. The responsibility preserves a meaningful distinction between evidence, interpretation and the report that a service is prepared to authorise.&quot;},&quot;baseline_placement&quot;:{&quot;canonical_id&quot;:&quot;CT1-DIAGNOSTIC-THERAPEUTIC-CLINICAL-SUPPORT-SERVICES.CT2-DIAGNOSTIC-SUPPORT-PROVISION.CT3-DIAGNOSTIC-REPORT-MANAGEMENT&quot;,&quot;owner_key&quot;:null,&quot;parent_key&quot;:&quot;business-capability:diagnostic-support-provision&quot;,&quot;tier&quot;:&quot;CT3&quot;},&quot;baseline_unresolved&quot;:[&quot;relevance&quot;],&quot;baseline_version&quot;:&quot;0.1&quot;,&quot;canonical_id&quot;:&quot;CT1-DIAGNOSTIC-THERAPEUTIC-CLINICAL-SUPPORT-SERVICES.CT2-DIAGNOSTIC-SUPPORT-PROVISION.CT3-DIAGNOSTIC-REPORT-MANAGEMENT&quot;,&quot;canonical_name&quot;:&quot;Diagnostic Report Management&quot;,&quot;category&quot;:&quot;business&quot;,&quot;governed_definition_latex&quot;:&quot;\nEstablish and govern the authoritative expression of diagnostic findings, including applicable creation, review, amendment, verification, finalisation and authorisation/\\allowbreak{}signing.\n\n&quot;,&quot;id_aliases&quot;:[],&quot;key&quot;:&quot;business-capability:diagnostic-report-management&quot;,&quot;latex_label&quot;:&quot;cap:bc-diagnostic-report-management&quot;,&quot;local_id&quot;:&quot;DIAGNOSTIC-REPORT-MANAGEMENT&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Diagnostic Report Management&quot;,&quot;name_aliases&quot;:[],&quot;name_status&quot;:&quot;Canonical&quot;,&quot;owner_identifier&quot;:null,&quot;owner_key&quot;:null,&quot;parent_identifier&quot;:&quot;HCM-BC-diagnostic-support-provision&quot;,&quot;parent_key&quot;:&quot;business-capability:diagnostic-support-provision&quot;,&quot;placement_status&quot;:&quot;Established&quot;,&quot;record_state&quot;:&quot;current&quot;,&quot;reference_id&quot;:&quot;HCM-BC-diagnostic-report-management&quot;,&quot;responsibility_owner_key&quot;:null,&quot;source_rad_documents&quot;:[&quot;docs/markdown/02-strategy/capabilities/business-capabilities.md&quot;],&quot;sources&quot;:[{&quot;anchor&quot;:&quot;ct2--diagnostic-support-provision&quot;,&quot;line&quot;:472,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;business&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;| Diagnostic Report Management | Establish and govern the authoritative expression of diagnostic findings, including applicable creation, review, amendment, verification, finalisation and authorisation/signing. |&quot;},{&quot;anchor&quot;:&quot;ct2--diagnostic-support-provision&quot;,&quot;line&quot;:463,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;business&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;**Decomposition assertion:** Each named child in this table is a CT3 Business Capability whose immediate CT2 parent is Diagnostic Support Provision; that CT2 has the CT1 parent stated above.&quot;},{&quot;anchor&quot;:&quot;ct2--diagnostic-support-provision&quot;,&quot;line&quot;:475,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;business&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;**Boundary:** Scheduling ≠ performance ≠ evidence management ≠ interpretation ≠ governed report ≠ distribution. Specimen and data responsibilities remain distinct. Diagnostic interpretation does not establish patient-level Clinical Determination from the total clinical context. Generic appointments are distinct from diagnostic-specific constraints. Diagnostic Order Management is not established here as a subordinate capability. Signing/f