              <folder name="II.1.2.6.2.2 [CT3] Medication Compounding &amp; Preparation" id="id-bb645e97cfcd497e8babe9487af571aa">
                <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.2.6.2.2. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=07380933da66427c865ca8e64d414e59; Exchange identifier=id-b83111228d98546a97d1f6a1ad0387ad. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[CT3] Medication Compounding &amp; Preparation" id="id-b83111228d98546a97d1f6a1ad0387ad">
                  <documentation>Prepare or compound a clinically required medication formulation under the applicable professional and product-governance mandate.

**Overview**

Prepare or compound a clinically required medication formulation under the applicable professional and product-governance mandate. The proposed decomposition separates this outcome from the other responsibilities within Medication &amp; Pharmacy Services.

**Intent**

Provide the required medication formulation when ordinary supply alone does not satisfy the authorised preparation need.

**Boundary**

Preparation differs from dispensing and administration; this proposal assigns no compounding activity to Harmonia.</documentation>
