              <folder name="II.1.2.7.1.4 [CT3] Clinical Knowledge Information Formulation" id="id-b2fabdab4d7e4c639dc14d1b7164b7a6">
                <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.2.7.1.4. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=05421be130ff4020b119c314aca46573; Exchange identifier=id-820d3b4a4e6259608e1be64c809a8103. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[CT3] Clinical Knowledge Information Formulation" id="id-820d3b4a4e6259608e1be64c809a8103">
                  <documentation>Formulate explicit reusable knowledge, including applicability, qualifications, rationale and evidence relationships.

This capability expresses reusable clinical knowledge with its applicability, qualifications, rationale and evidence relationships. It moves beyond extracted material by making the knowledge claim and its limits explicit. That formulation supports later review and use while retaining the distinction between a proposed knowledge expression and one approved for a governed purpose.

**Boundary**

Formulation does not approve knowledge, govern terminology or define health-information structures.</documentation>
