mation authority. Device monitoring remains externally provided enablement, with provider unestablished. Monitoring, maintenance and lifecycle disposition have distinct meanings. The Maintenance membership discrepancy is preserved under Unresolved Business Capability matters; no eighth CT3 is inferred.&quot;}],&quot;structural_id_status&quot;:&quot;Established&quot;,&quot;tier&quot;:&quot;CT2&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;capability&quot;,&quot;unresolved&quot;:[&quot;relevance&quot;],&quot;views&quot;:[&quot;region:care--health-delivery&quot;]}"/>
