              <folder name="II.1.2.11.1.2 [CT3] Assurance Evidence Assessment" id="id-675c18f134c84029bd65f7c5c588db15">
                <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.2.11.1.2. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=1b295763b37f4622bd1bb80c6ea3741c; Exchange identifier=id-f7b1410300485ff3a1f03dc2cb35ce34. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[CT3] Assurance Evidence Assessment" id="id-f7b1410300485ff3a1f03dc2cb35ce34">
                  <documentation>Evaluate available evidence against the established assurance approach and criteria.

Assurance Evidence Assessment evaluates available evidence against the established approach and criteria. It produces the assessed basis from which a legitimate conclusion may be determined, retaining qualifications and evidentiary limits. The responsibility is evaluative rather than the operational production of the source information or remediation of what it reveals.

**Boundary**

Assessment is distinct from conclusion determination; unavailable or insufficient evidence must remain explicit.</documentation>
