| enabled_by | [[CT3] Assurance Criteria Administration](1bfd71f24321428c8871b587d413f47e.md) | established / current | Serving (reverse) — `id-c295945ce3c152ec928b03bc088dc501` |
| enabled_by | [[CT3] Governed Assurance](da1a983d4dcf4d5bb772b8f69bc08426.md) | established / preserved historical assertion | Serving (reverse) — `id-ba72377c329452b189e6d787bf9d8a74` |

