            <folder name="II.1.2.12.2 [CT2] Health Service Modelling" id="id-f733d1d2d1e9406690b278a19bd32f88">
              <folder name="II.1.2.12.2.1 [CT3] Health Service Capability Identification" id="id-00743b88412c44859fe7836d0a4f8cbd">
                <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.2.12.2.1. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=53f64a402905438aa87f9d16eff876da; Exchange identifier=id-f24b2bd3966552018ad898a63b48cc4c. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[CT3] Health Service Capability Identification" id="id-f24b2bd3966552018ad898a63b48cc4c">
                  <documentation>Identify the ordinary business abilities needed to satisfy the service need across clinical, workforce, facility, technology, information and support concerns.

This capability identifies the ordinary business abilities a proposed service needs across clinical, workforce, facility, information, technology and support concerns. It broadens service modelling beyond a clinical description to the conditions needed for viability. Its contribution is an understanding of required abilities, leaving their fulfilment and governing authority with the appropriate responsibilities.

**Boundary**

The word capability here does not allocate Harmonia CT tiers or establish new catalogue elements.</documentation>
