                  <property key="v0.2 / Source Locators" value="[{&quot;anchor&quot;:&quot;ct2--health-system-planning&quot;,&quot;line&quot;:627,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;business&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;| Health Service Capacity Planning | Determine required strategic/tactical capacity to address assessed demand. |&quot;},{&quot;anchor&quot;:&quot;ct2--health-system-planning&quot;,&quot;line&quot;:622,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;business&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;**Decomposition assertion:** Each named child in this table is a CT3 Business Capability whose immediate CT2 parent is Health-System Planning; that CT2 has the CT1 parent stated above.&quot;},{&quot;anchor&quot;:&quot;ct2--health-system-planning&quot;,&quot;line&quot;:630,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;business&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;**Boundary:** Population-health evidence does not predetermine a demand conclusion. Individual care demand differs from health-system demand; required capacity differs from established or operationally usable capacity. Planning owns neither underlying resources nor operational allocation/deployment. Planned footprint differs from managed locations and identifiable offerings. Detailed commissioning, funding, capital, infrastructure and workforce planning remain intentionally unmodelled.&quot;}]"/>
