              <folder name="II.1.2.15.2.3 [CT3] Population Health Longitudinal Assessment" id="id-bdf86ef7ac6d45ee987255468322bb54">
                <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.2.15.2.3. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=4d52b8acda504329a595be27a736e63c; Exchange identifier=id-e9a47db12b015e619c1e4718be7fc8df. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[CT3] Population Health Longitudinal Assessment" id="id-e9a47db12b015e619c1e4718be7fc8df">
                  <documentation>Establish population-health state, patterns and change over time from applicable evidence.

This capability establishes population-health state, patterns and change over time from relevant evidence. It interprets information at a population scope rather than treating a collection of individual observations as a population conclusion by itself. Its longitudinal purpose makes the temporal and population basis important to the meaning of the assessment.

**Boundary**

Population assessment is not preventative-programme performance, an individual health conclusion or a service-demand decision.</documentation>
