| enabled_by | [[CT3] Data Provenance Capture](44a7937520a54945b06b5fd4a2bbd870.md) | Proposed / current | Serving (reverse) — `id-1504246dc6c1500a8eedadc2eed72edf` |
| enabled_by | [[CT3] Information Authority Representation](8c850faafb334f97a81a0b4cd8fdb65f.md) | Proposed / preserved historical assertion | Serving (reverse) — `id-22d04cf7fdbc5b53b2bae9dd578092f8` |</documentation>
