              <folder name="II.1.2.17.1.2 [CT3] Classification Utilisation Oversight" id="id-c67cefbe4e15403b9b6d7082160c64c3">
                <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.2.17.1.2. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=1d7c50aa80464613864dd6efb3fb56cc; Exchange identifier=id-0d82b50617d05608ba73f130916a07c3. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[CT3] Classification Utilisation Oversight" id="id-0d82b50617d05608ba73f130916a07c3">
                  <documentation>Oversee appropriate organisational application of classifications.

Classification Utilisation Oversight evaluates appropriate organisational application of classifications. It addresses whether information is treated consistently with the governed sensitivity meaning, rather than assuming that an established classification scheme guarantees correct use. This retains a distinct responsibility for practice alongside definition governance.

**Boundary**

Oversight neither creates classification definitions nor establishes a new localisation peer.</documentation>
