              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[CT2] Care Documentation &amp; Communication Enablement" id="id-ddefa589dee05b94ab470e11f3b0540c">
                <documentation>Administer the lifecycle, shared-plan context and directed communication of care documentation.

**Overview**

Administer the lifecycle, shared-plan context and directed communication of care documentation. Its constituent abilities distinguish Clinical Record Administration; Care Plan Administration; Clinical Communication Administration.

**Intent**

Preserve which document or plan applies and what a directed recipient has actually acknowledged.

**Boundary**

This frame does not absorb longitudinal synthesis, collaboration discourse, originating clinical decisions or generic transport.</documentation>
