                  <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.1.5.1.1. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=7332de92e6c14bc8b071cf18f78f9525; Exchange identifier=id-3a7f53d246f6577c904c5980bdc3cb81. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Care Goal &amp; Plan Progression Representation" id="id-3a7f53d246f6577c904c5980bdc3cb81" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Represent externally agreed care goals, participants and plan changes with their effective standing.

**Overview**

Plan ingestion/distribution is complemented by the ability to distinguish the applicable goal and plan context as a shared plan progresses.

**Boundary**

Representing a goal does not choose treatment, determine clinical completion or grant plan approval authority.</documentation>
