                    <documentation>Ingest multidisciplinary care plans and syndicate updates to authorized care team members.

Care-plan exchange keeps authorised team members aware of established multidisciplinary intent and its updates. It provides information continuity while preserving clinical planning authority and the distinction between a distributed plan and care actually performed.</documentation>
