                    <documentation>Ingest home visit notes, community nursing observations, and social support assessments.

Community encounter ingestion brings home-visit and community assessments into the longitudinal information context. It supports continuity across organisational boundaries while preserving source attribution and the difference between the documentation received and care performed by the platform.</documentation>
