                  <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.1.5.3.1. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=464ee3ad8d3648d992c6e51e3632d593; Exchange identifier=id-b08a20a5f0025228927e240825fe0372. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Outreach Encounter Outcome Ingestion" id="id-b08a20a5f0025228927e240825fe0372" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Ingest and reconcile clinical documentation gathered during rural and remote outreach visits.

Outreach outcome ingestion brings documentation collected during remote visits back into the governed record. It reconnects previously separated activity with the regional context without erasing when, where and by whom the source information was established.</documentation>
