                <folder name="II.1.3.1.5.3.2 [Feature] Outreach Visit Context Provision" id="id-1f89e5322c90486f865c42f3a8b6378b">
                  <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.1.5.3.2. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=44049d029a41437685272dfe94db4a2a; Exchange identifier=id-c1beacb024da5f76afcbc6579e875d04. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Outreach Visit Context Provision" id="id-c1beacb024da5f76afcbc6579e875d04" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Package and deliver portable clinical summaries and offline-capable care summaries for remote outreach clinics.

Outreach context provision prepares portable summaries for care beyond the usual connected environment. Their usefulness depends on retaining clinical and temporal context; an offline-capable copy is not automatically current authoritative state or a new origin of clinical facts.</documentation>
                    <property key="v0.2 / Source Capture Key" value="feature:outreach-visit-context-provision"/>
