                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Demographic Change Distribution" id="id-35f2e62266245c35ae0957b13f0899d7" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Fan out verified client demographic updates to downstream clinical subsystems.

Change distribution propagates verified demographic updates to participating clinical systems. It supports consistent subject context across the network while keeping delivery to each destination distinguishable from that destination's eventual incorporation or business response.</documentation>
