                  <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.1.6.2.1. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=47bab2681bf943899e83fab8c9941676; Exchange identifier=id-9bff89837605529e9289be57afb905d6. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Immunisation Event Submission" id="id-9bff89837605529e9289be57afb905d6" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Ingest point-of-care immunisation administration records and syndicate to national immunization registers.

Immunisation submission connects a source-recorded administration event with the national register context. It supports continuity and reporting without performing the immunisation or making successful transmission equivalent to every downstream registry outcome.</documentation>
