                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Screening Recall Notification Distribution" id="id-54c51ccb433e50bc874d2953adcfb82c" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Distribute clinical screening reminders and recall notices to designated healthcare providers.

Screening recall distribution conveys established reminders to the designated care providers. Its notification responsibility is expressible through approved event and workflow composition; the catalogue does not invent a specialised Function or transfer the clinical decision to recall the patient.</documentation>
