              <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.1.7. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Historical predecessor: R.2.56 [CT2] Clinical Charging &amp; Claims Administration; canonicalId=44433108cc8f4f5f9d7581f9e5b29eb5; Exchange identifier=id-740d5118859d5f269f7dbdfed7de3447 Canonical element directory: canonicalId=af78ab7c89454a608cd4d34ec7703331; Exchange identifier=id-5463239c9ef65cef98c5274ab6e8f6db. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[CT2] Clinical Charging &amp; Claims Administration" id="id-5463239c9ef65cef98c5274ab6e8f6db">
                <documentation>This capability supplies clinical activity summaries and charging records to billing contexts. It preserves a route from activity information to the systems responsible for financial processing without treating the export as a completed bill or claim. No Feature decomposition or comprehensive revenue-cycle responsibility is established.

**Overview**

This capability supplies clinical activity summaries and charging records to billing contexts. It preserves a route from activity information to the systems responsible for financial processing without treating the export as a completed bill or claim. No Feature decomposition or comprehensive revenue-cycle responsibility is established.

**Intent**

This capability supplies clinical activity summaries and charging records to billing contexts. It preserves a route from activity information to the systems responsible for financial processing without treating the export as a completed bill or claim. No Feature decomposition or comprehensive revenue-cycle responsibility is established.

**Boundary**

Information administration does not confer authority over the represented person, organisation, service, place, device or clinical activity.

---

## History

### Boundary — predecessor explanation

Export of activity evidence does not confer pricing, billing, claim or accounting authority.

### Harmonia Architectural Relevance — predecessor explanation

Its Adjacent standing reflects information supplied to financial systems while the financial activity remains externally governed.

## ARB identity continuity

Historical identity [44433108cc8f4f5f9d7581f9e5b29eb5](44433108cc8f4f5f9d7581f9e5b29eb5.md) has direct correspondence with this capability under HCRL 1.1.5-002. Historical provenance and UUID reservation remain with that record; this resource retains its existing identity and independent standing.</documentation>
