                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Clinical Communication Distribution" id="id-5a0cb2b52e4b5dc0864b86c6baff897a" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Distribute secure clinical communications between verified healthcare providers and designated care team endpoints.

Clinical communication distribution connects verified providers and designated team endpoints through governed addressed delivery. The responsibility concerns reaching the intended participant, rather than assuming that delivered information has been read, incorporated or acted upon clinically.</documentation>
