                <folder name="II.1.3.1.8.1.2 [Feature] Communication Audit Logging" id="id-5cbad671651e429ab48908591af44e5a">
                  <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.1.8.1.2. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=b9df49b2f221486392f5cc393369d888; Exchange identifier=id-47bd63bf8323578c86caf2ae6a18f3d8. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Communication Audit Logging" id="id-47bd63bf8323578c86caf2ae6a18f3d8" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Maintain an enduring, non-PHI, tamper-evident log of all clinical communication transactions.

Communication audit evidence preserves the attributable transaction history required for scrutiny of clinical communication. It records meaningful communication facts under the zero-PHI constraints rather than turning the audit trail into a copy of message content or a permanent diagnostic trace.</documentation>
