                <folder name="II.1.3.1.8.1.3 [Feature] Delivery Acknowledgement Tracking" id="id-dce7e7817fae4cba87a650f3d76acc6b">
                  <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.1.8.1.3. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=6884eb06bb794c5b8513b9b63d69af7e; Exchange identifier=id-801fe8f13b7f525cacd29bd5ad21f1aa. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Delivery Acknowledgement Tracking" id="id-801fe8f13b7f525cacd29bd5ad21f1aa" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Correlate recipient delivery and read receipts with outbound clinical communications, distinguishing transport delivery from recipient acknowledgement. Receipt/read evidence does not by itself establish business acceptance, clinical review, incorporation, approval, finality or originating authority.

Acknowledgement tracking associates delivery and read evidence with the communication transaction. Each receipt retains its contractual meaning; neither delivery nor reading alone proves business acceptance, clinical review, approval, finality or originating authority.</documentation>
                    <property key="v0.2 / Source Capture Key" value="feature:delivery-acknowledgement-tracking"/>
                    <property key="v0.2 / Snapshot Reference ID" value="FEAT-SA-28"/>
