## ARB identity continuity

Historical identity [bd4d6f4a7f03402ba7857383c7be7a4c](bd4d6f4a7f03402ba7857383c7be7a4c.md) has direct correspondence with this capability under HCRL 1.1.5-002. Historical provenance and UUID reservation remain with that record; this resource retains its existing identity and independent standing.

## ARB source correspondence

Scope/anti-responsibility and clinical/operational meaning establish the responsible Capability; descriptive ledger/registry/asset labels do not establish a separately bounded formal Information Concept. Preserve non-transfer and source authority.

Source: `docs/markdown/03-business-architecture/information-responsibility/information-responsibility.md` — information responsibility row 20. Standing: Established Business responsibility only; formal information identity/lifecycle not inferred.

```text
| **Clinical Communication Administration** | **Clinical Message Dispatch &amp; Audit Register** | Secure message dispatch logs, end-to-end business delivery acknowledgements (business ACKs), and non-repudiation communication audit trails. | Does not own the clinical content of messages. |
```</documentation>
