                <folder name="II.1.3.1.9.1.2 [Feature] Document Metadata Indexing" id="id-b5b506b92c4b45d5aec838e92421866e">
                  <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.1.9.1.2. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=0c85a269e90a4329b83d934f9061cd49; Exchange identifier=id-907bd80b5a7a5b8c81468b8b4bc80958. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Document Metadata Indexing" id="id-907bd80b5a7a5b8c81468b8b4bc80958" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Index clinical document metadata (author, specialty, encounter, date, confidentiality) for rapid discovery.

Metadata indexing makes documents discoverable by clinically and operationally relevant attributes. It describes content for search without making the index the document itself or granting access merely because a matching record can be located.</documentation>
