                <folder name="II.1.3.1.9.1.3 [Feature] Document Versioning &amp; Supersession" id="id-a161acac674740e8a83e113913e0d8ea">
                  <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.1.9.1.3. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=c8e2e623dd4e4c3b8de6c3bfb8c2a3ee; Exchange identifier=id-c2d307b43e135f2aa2d68dbb8a58661e. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Document Versioning &amp; Supersession" id="id-c2d307b43e135f2aa2d68dbb8a58661e" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Manage document classification, author attribution, amendment attribution, versioning, and supersession or withdrawal without destructive data loss.

Versioning and supersession make document change understandable without destructive loss of the previous account. Author and amendment attribution distinguish who established each contribution; withdrawal or correction changes current standing without retrospectively erasing what Harmonia previously received or managed.</documentation>
