## ARB source correspondence

Scope/anti-responsibility and clinical/operational meaning establish the responsible Capability; descriptive ledger/registry/asset labels do not establish a separately bounded formal Information Concept. Preserve non-transfer and source authority.

Source: `docs/markdown/03-business-architecture/information-responsibility/information-responsibility.md` — information responsibility row 18. Standing: Established Business responsibility only; formal information identity/lifecycle not inferred.

```text
| **Clinical Record Administration** | **Clinical Document Registry &amp; Lifecycle State** | Clinical document master metadata, structured and narrative document repository, document version histories, addenda links, and legal document states (*Draft* to *Superseded*). | Does not own real-time collaborative discussion transcripts. |
```</documentation>
