                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Diagnostic History Consolidation" id="id-6641d905b9765c6380aa6b335dc4200a" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Consolidate historical diagnostic trends (e.g., cumulative laboratory results) across multiple regional providers into an integrated view.

Diagnostic history consolidation makes prior evidence visible across regional providers. A combined historical view can support comparison over time without itself establishing a diagnostic interpretation, reconciling conflicting clinical assertions or replacing each report's source standing.</documentation>
