                <folder name="II.1.3.1.10.1.2 [Feature] Laboratory &amp; Imaging Result Distribution" id="id-290a09ae071041cea752f6951eb37e91">
                  <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.1.10.1.2. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=93d42becda8f4850b73ff2c93bb7e8f3; Exchange identifier=id-8cc1576660195c098afae0eb858958bd. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Laboratory &amp; Imaging Result Distribution" id="id-8cc1576660195c098afae0eb858958bd" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Reliably distribute structured diagnostic reports (pathology, radiology) to ordering clinicians and designated secondary recipients.

Result distribution connects established diagnostic reports with ordering and designated secondary recipients. It supports continuity of diagnostic information across care settings while retaining the distinction between delivery, recipient review and the clinical decision based on the result.</documentation>
