                  <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.1.10.2.1. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=7449ee4dada7424ea6d39785258b4981; Exchange identifier=id-790a8b7d12b65899b81a59248847861d. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Diagnostic Preliminary &amp; Corrected Report Handling" id="id-790a8b7d12b65899b81a59248847861d" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Receive, qualify and distribute preliminary, corrected and addendum diagnostic information with its relationship to prior reports.

**Overview**

The finalised-report Feature remains unchanged. The broader documented diagnostic behaviour needs a separate frame for information whose preliminary or correction standing is material.

**Boundary**

Does not originate diagnostic interpretation or silently overwrite a previously received report.</documentation>
