                <folder name="II.1.3.1.10.2.2 [Feature] Diagnostic Report Distribution" id="id-03f16add57af448f9e6d3396d608eff5">
                  <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.1.10.2.2. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=3813b3b5175e461ba74805d8fa2aa648; Exchange identifier=id-6ffaf46cf2715eb28cd85d28c24c7d0a. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Diagnostic Report Distribution" id="id-6ffaf46cf2715eb28cd85d28c24c7d0a" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Distribute finalized laboratory, pathology, and imaging reports to ordering clinicians and designated care teams.

This Feature distributes finalised diagnostic reports to the ordering and designated care participants. Its narrower finalised-report scope is preserved even though broader Diagnostic Administration behaviour also handles preliminary, corrected and addendum information; those behaviours do not silently redefine the Feature.</documentation>
