                <folder name="II.1.3.1.10.2.3 [Feature] Diagnostic Report Ingestion &amp; Binding" id="id-6451f69bb0784a1bb7dba6bdf43193db">
                  <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.1.10.2.3. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=a00823445a8a44c1a00f3ec93a7e0e6f; Exchange identifier=id-edd2707ca7e458b190c0e857d51bc695. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Diagnostic Report Ingestion &amp; Binding" id="id-edd2707ca7e458b190c0e857d51bc695" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Ingest finalized laboratory and radiology reports, verifying content integrity and binding them to the parent order.

Report ingestion binds a finalised diagnostic contribution to the order it answers and verifies content integrity. The report's professional standing comes from its diagnostic source; successful ingestion does not independently authorise its findings or establish a patient-level clinical conclusion.</documentation>
                    <property key="v0.2 / Source Capture Key" value="feature:diagnostic-report-ingestion--binding"/>
                    <property key="v0.2 / Snapshot Reference ID" value="FEAT-SA-16"/>
                    <property key="v0.2 / LaTeX Label" value="feature:feat-sa-16"/>
                    <property key="v0.2 / Construct Type" value="feature"/>
