                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[CT3] Diagnostic Workflow Management" id="id-a0b4e1a965765006a8dc7b598f517bb3">
                  <documentation>Administer the established diagnostic workflow management information and coordination responsibility while preserving its source authority.

**Overview**

Administer the established diagnostic workflow management information and coordination responsibility while preserving its source authority. The reviewed hierarchy assigns this enduring ability to its stated business-enabling context.

**Intent**

Administer the established diagnostic workflow management information and coordination responsibility while preserving its source authority.

**Boundary**

Information administration and coordination preserve the authority of the responsible source, clinical actor and governed domain; they confer no additional real-world management authority.</documentation>
