                  <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.1.11.1.1. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=90de621f7ac1410eb6fc770cb07a9e03; Exchange identifier=id-2b78a0d9086258329d7c35d562d218a8. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Acute Care Clinical Context Provision" id="id-2b78a0d9086258329d7c35d562d218a8" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Provide consolidated longitudinal history and active medication lists to acute care clinicians at point of triage.

Acute context provision brings relevant history and active medications together for clinicians facing a current presentation. It supports rapid understanding without substituting the consolidated view for clinical assessment, triage or a decision about treatment.</documentation>
