                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[CT3] Encounter Lifecycle Management" id="id-db254db117db5f77926aa5add9ddb6bc">
                  <documentation>Administer the established encounter lifecycle management information and coordination responsibility while preserving its source authority.

**Overview**

Administer the established encounter lifecycle management information and coordination responsibility while preserving its source authority. The reviewed hierarchy assigns this enduring ability to its stated business-enabling context.

**Intent**

Administer the established encounter lifecycle management information and coordination responsibility while preserving its source authority.

**Boundary**

Information administration and coordination preserve the authority of the responsible source, clinical actor and governed domain; they confer no additional real-world management authority.</documentation>
