                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Dispense Event Tracking" id="id-27b82b85e02654628f22891f870d6379" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Ingest medication dispense verification records from pharmacy management systems.

Dispense tracking receives the pharmacy's evidence that medication was supplied under the applicable context. It connects supply with the medication account without inferring that the patient received a dose or that Harmonia performed the professional dispensing activity.</documentation>
