                <folder name="II.1.3.1.13.1.2 [Feature] Medication Administration Record (MAR) Ingestion" id="id-b291ef0c13b74f88a01c092b279afea5">
                  <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.1.13.1.2. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=779d9cb66bc84585a8dd1f456b0ee37c; Exchange identifier=id-9c97bc1a60fa5266a83e994d2dc0f169. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Medication Administration Record (MAR) Ingestion" id="id-9c97bc1a60fa5266a83e994d2dc0f169" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Ingest point-of-care medication administration events.

MAR ingestion captures source-reported point-of-care administration events. It preserves the crucial distinction between intended or supplied medication and an administration recorded as performed, without originating that bedside event or its clinical authority.</documentation>
