                  <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.1.13.1.3. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=5247b47f181243bb975ae2cd70db65ba; Exchange identifier=id-41f5134accc85a82904baca65799badc. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Medication Order Ingestion" id="id-41f5134accc85a82904baca65799badc" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Ingest inpatient and discharge prescription orders.

Medication order ingestion preserves the intended therapy expressed by inpatient or discharge prescriptions. The received order is evidence of clinical intent, distinct from pharmacy dispensing and the patient's subsequent administration record.</documentation>
                    <property key="v0.2 / Source Capture Key" value="feature:medication-order-ingestion"/>
