                <folder name="II.1.3.1.14.1.1 [Feature] Order Cancellation &amp; Modification Coordination" id="id-5bf8a0354d00413492eca5a8d585f7b3">
                  <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.1.14.1.1. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=6d12d9ddf4f8425ca60b289f3356f683; Exchange identifier=id-9dc2181af703551bbff54b8af0a2c8cb. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Order Cancellation &amp; Modification Coordination" id="id-9dc2181af703551bbff54b8af0a2c8cb" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Coordinate order cancellation and amendment requests, ensuring synchronization with performing systems.

Cancellation and amendment coordination carries a requested change into the performing-system context. It preserves the difference between asking to change an order and evidence that the change took effect, rather than silently rewriting the original request as though no prior intent existed.</documentation>
