                <folder name="II.1.3.1.14.1.2 [Feature] Order Closed-Loop Progression Tracking" id="id-b313dc1d887545a7b3899b354a0ab23b">
                  <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.1.14.1.2. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=9e63463942b94a6ba3bc045a04d3580b; Exchange identifier=id-157ff4007a5450beb816543f882416fa. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Order Closed-Loop Progression Tracking" id="id-157ff4007a5450beb816543f882416fa" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Track order progression across destination determination, routing, delivery, receipt acknowledgement (distinguishing technical delivery acknowledgement from business acknowledgement), execution progress, completion, and outcome association.

Closed-loop tracking keeps delivery, technical acknowledgement, business disposition, execution and returned outcome distinct. Its purpose is to expose what has actually been established at each stage, preventing a successful handoff from being reported as eventual fulfilment.</documentation>
                    <property key="v0.2 / Source Capture Key" value="feature:order-closed-loop-progression-tracking"/>
                    <property key="v0.2 / Snapshot Reference ID" value="FEAT-SA-13"/>
                    <property key="v0.2 / LaTeX Label" value="feature:feat-sa-13"/>
                    <property key="v0.2 / Construct Type" value="feature"/>
