                <folder name="II.1.3.1.14.1.4 [Feature] Order Outcome Association" id="id-7d1a5bb5acef4514bf59cd68c55f6cb9">
                  <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.1.14.1.4. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=4ad2e11162f34775adfea01b949d2803; Exchange identifier=id-45230eebe97658aab88ff8abcbc9d37b. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Order Outcome Association" id="id-45230eebe97658aab88ff8abcbc9d37b" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Associate an externally established outcome with the applicable bounded order and its progression.

**Overview**

Execution completion and returned outcome are different checkpoints. This Feature makes the result link explicit without equating an order acknowledgement with an outcome.

**Boundary**

Does not interpret diagnostic findings or declare fulfilment from transport delivery alone.</documentation>
