                  <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.1.15.1.2. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=12e0f64cff2043339be17fb38708247a; Exchange identifier=id-c22c7a1a106758c297225365f528dddb. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Procedure Booking Ingestion" id="id-c22c7a1a106758c297225365f528dddb" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Ingest scheduled surgical case bookings and procedural requests.

Procedure booking ingestion makes scheduled cases and procedural requests available in the wider care context. It conveys intended or arranged activity while retaining the distinction between a booked procedure and one actually performed.</documentation>
