                <folder name="II.1.3.1.16.1.3 [Feature] Referral Status &amp; Outcome Tracking" id="id-9edd64893a884f89927386937d30378e">
                  <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.1.16.1.3. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=836fa704f7b24bfc8f7eeb72a36bb897; Exchange identifier=id-a81241907aa15de294c53e8dc44d9367. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Referral Status &amp; Outcome Tracking" id="id-a81241907aa15de294c53e8dc44d9367" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Track referral operational progression and communicate referral outcomes (acceptance, decline, or redirection) to referring providers.

Status and outcome tracking makes explicit referral dispositions visible to the referring participant. Acceptance, decline and redirection remain meaningful alternatives; a transport acknowledgement does not fill in a missing business decision or establish a universal referral progression.</documentation>
                    <property key="v0.2 / Source Capture Key" value="feature:referral-status--outcome-tracking"/>
