                  <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.1.17.1.1. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=1d5bc2b1742544728357fbea42a55ec4; Exchange identifier=id-5c8267d2b067511591a88922b37ab219. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Appointment Notification Ingestion" id="id-5c8267d2b067511591a88922b37ab219" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Ingest scheduled appointment events from departmental scheduling systems.

Appointment ingestion receives scheduling facts established by departmental systems. It supports shared awareness of planned care opportunities without claiming authority over the underlying booking decision or proving that attendance and clinical fulfilment will occur.</documentation>
