                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Appointment Status Synchronization" id="id-a8db07a831405f489c73236896b52c25" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Propagate booking cancellations, reschedules, and attendances across care coordination systems.

Status synchronisation keeps cancellation, rescheduling and attendance information coherent across coordination contexts. The purpose is propagation of the externally established booking change rather than independent scheduling or inference of a clinical outcome from appointment state.</documentation>
