            <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[CT1] Care Administration Enablement" id="id-fe7b5e3e02bb53f59ab89c27a81e9e18">
              <documentation>Administer the information and progression of care access, requests, encounters, records and plans across responsible care systems.

**Overview**

Administer the information and progression of care access, requests, encounters, records and plans across responsible care systems.

**Intent**

Administer the information and progression of care access, requests, encounters, records and plans across responsible care systems.

**Boundary**

Information administration does not perform the clinical act, own host booking engines or infer Transfer of Care from referral acceptance.

## ARB identity continuity

Historical identity [b611a1fcfadb4b30af9ba74a4c993d8a](b611a1fcfadb4b30af9ba74a4c993d8a.md) has direct correspondence with this capability under HCRL 1.1.5-002. Historical provenance and UUID reservation remain with that record; this resource retains its existing identity and independent standing.</documentation>
