            <folder name="II.1.3.2.2 [CT2] Longitudinal &amp; Community Care Integration [superseded]" id="id-550f8c9c1dcc47c8903abecd1bb72b9e">
              <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.2.2. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=8430d50adc504ecc959f15b7cbbcd095; Exchange identifier=id-6a2eb8694bb1540b9d1f64051ee43dc3. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[CT2] Longitudinal &amp; Community Care Integration" id="id-6a2eb8694bb1540b9d1f64051ee43dc3">
                <documentation>Support continuity, remote participation and preventive follow-up through appropriately assembled and exchanged care context.

**Overview**

Support continuity, remote participation and preventive follow-up through appropriately assembled and exchanged care context. Its constituent abilities distinguish Primary Care; Community Care; Outreach Care; Remote &amp; Virtual Care; Preventive Care.

**Intent**

Support continuity when care information must follow the person across providers, visits and distance.

**Boundary**

Longitudinal purpose does not make these care contexts exclusive. Outreach location and remote mode remain distinct from source clinical responsibility.</documentation>
