## Source-qualified contribution

Source: `docs/markdown/03-business-architecture/behaviours/01-entity-management.md` — entry lines 69-69. Standing: exact originating assertion; current resource standing unchanged.

- **Owning Capability**: `Client Privacy`.

## ARB identity continuity

Historical identity [d2e6078b5db041cb904e0cadcebce6eb](d2e6078b5db041cb904e0cadcebce6eb.md) has direct correspondence with this capability under HCRL 1.1.5-002. Historical provenance and UUID reservation remain with that record; this resource retains its existing identity and independent standing.

## ARB source correspondence

Scope/anti-responsibility and clinical/operational meaning establish the responsible Capability; descriptive ledger/registry/asset labels do not establish a separately bounded formal Information Concept. Preserve non-transfer and source authority.

Source: `docs/markdown/03-business-architecture/information-responsibility/information-responsibility.md` — information responsibility row 4. Standing: Established Business responsibility only; formal information identity/lifecycle not inferred.

```text
| **Client Privacy** | **Client Consent &amp; Privacy Directives** | Patient consent preferences, opt-in/opt-out records, sensitive health category exclusions, and disclosure restriction directives. | Does not own access control policy evaluation rules. |
```</documentation>
