                <folder name="II.1.3.4.1.2.1 [Feature] Next-of-Kin &amp; Guardian Association" id="id-f22bcc3cb09b46d08620a304dd5c655e">
                  <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.4.1.2.1. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=05de74a8a7dc4334ba60543a228e73cb; Exchange identifier=id-66c6ae94ed8a5c2bbc3fdeac8cb70152. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Next-of-Kin &amp; Guardian Association" id="id-66c6ae94ed8a5c2bbc3fdeac8cb70152" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Associate nominated emergency contacts, legal guardians, and care agents with the client record.

This Feature records the nominated people and capacities through which a client can be contacted or represented. Association preserves who the contact or guardian is in relation to the client; it does not make every nominated person an unrestricted recipient of clinical information.</documentation>
