                <folder name="II.1.3.4.1.4.6 [Feature] Identity Source &amp; Correction Lineage" id="id-7adabf4303ea4fccb0591c578f2fced8">
                  <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.4.1.4.6. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=d72134e75001449a9e7ffae53f61458f; Exchange identifier=id-bdf18b5e580b5b85a34357a3b21f36db. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Identity Source &amp; Correction Lineage" id="id-bdf18b5e580b5b85a34357a3b21f36db" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Retain source-attributed identity assertions and externally decided correction history.

**Overview**

Identifier correlations can change when an upstream authority corrects a relationship. Reviewers must be able to distinguish the source decision, its effective standing and the managed links affected.

**Boundary**

No probabilistic matching, golden-record selection or autonomous merge authority.</documentation>
