                  <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.4.2.1.1. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=df3dae0cf3044059875dbb888ea6a9ba; Exchange identifier=id-cf011e118aad5e158d838fa1c7f02e4b. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Device Serial Tracking" id="id-cf011e118aad5e158d838fa1c7f02e4b" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Ingest and maintain unique device identifier (UDI) records and serial numbers.

Serial tracking makes individual hardware distinguishable within the device estate. A unique device reference supports subsequent assignment and source interpretation, while remaining separate from evidence that the device is maintained, connected or fit for a particular clinical use.</documentation>
