                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[CT3] Device Connectivity Compliance Management" id="id-ec5e54de56ea59dbb41c9ab6477ffea5">
                  <documentation>Manage information about whether device connectivity satisfies applicable standards, policies and integration constraints.

**Overview**

Manage information about whether device connectivity satisfies applicable standards, policies and integration constraints. The reviewed hierarchy assigns this enduring ability to its stated business-enabling context.

**Intent**

Manage information about whether device connectivity satisfies applicable standards, policies and integration constraints.

**Boundary**

Endpoint registration alone does not establish compliance; conformity concerns applicable standards, policies and integration constraints.

## ARB identity continuity

Historical identity [9225f083d3474715a75af2a827a4016d](9225f083d3474715a75af2a827a4016d.md) has direct correspondence with this capability under HCRL 1.1.5-002. Historical provenance and UUID reservation remain with that record; this resource retains its existing identity and independent standing.</documentation>
