                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[CT3] Device Instance" id="id-73a3caf14181524195989816b0e12246">
                  <documentation>Tracking physical device hardware instances and serial numbers.

**Overview**

An identifiable physical device carries UDI and serial context through its use. The instance record supports association and resolution without originating device observations or making maintenance decisions.

**Intent**

Keep the identity of the actual physical equipment distinguishable from its model and endpoint.

**Boundary**

Identifies physical hardware; serial tracking is distinct from maintenance and live observation content.</documentation>
