                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Device Endpoint Registration" id="id-b42db284cbb651eb93b4011c2db855fc" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Register communication interfaces and security credentials for diagnostic telemetry feeds.

Endpoint registration supplies the interfaces and credential context through which a diagnostic or telemetry feed can participate. It describes provisioned connectivity rather than proving that data has arrived, been clinically interpreted or acquired authoritative standing.</documentation>
