                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[CT3] Device OA&amp;M Metadata Management" id="id-c7a85b3afdcf5eca8beba6058ebd91e7">
                  <documentation>Manage operational and administrative metadata needed to understand how a clinical device is connected, monitored and administered.

**Overview**

Manage operational and administrative metadata needed to understand how a clinical device is connected, monitored and administered. The reviewed hierarchy assigns this enduring ability to its stated business-enabling context.

**Intent**

Manage operational and administrative metadata needed to understand how a clinical device is connected, monitored and administered.

**Boundary**

Connectivity, monitoring and administration metadata do not perform device maintenance, interpret clinical telemetry or determine conformance.

## ARB identity continuity

Historical identity [a398c72bef094dee96c96d97994449fb](a398c72bef094dee96c96d97994449fb.md) has direct correspondence with this capability under HCRL 1.1.5-002. Historical provenance and UUID reservation remain with that record; this resource retains its existing identity and independent standing.</documentation>
