                  <documentation>Administer health-materiel catalogue and externally approved formulary information, preserving approval and version standing.

**Overview**

Administer health-materiel catalogue and externally approved formulary information, preserving approval and version standing.

**Intent**

Administer health-materiel catalogue and externally approved formulary information, preserving approval and version standing.

**Boundary**

Represents externally approved formularies; it does not acquire formulary approval or dispensing authority.

## ARB identity continuity

Historical identity [5c691959e2cc4a289fc25b9f3497eed9](5c691959e2cc4a289fc25b9f3497eed9.md) has direct correspondence with this capability under HCRL 1.1.5-002. Historical provenance and UUID reservation remain with that record; this resource retains its existing identity and independent standing.</documentation>
