                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[CT3] Health Materiel Profile Administration" id="id-f7048c29ae50565bad9ad68e7f030af4">
                  <documentation>Administer identifying and descriptive information about health materiel referenced in healthcare information and activity.

**Overview**

Administer identifying and descriptive information about health materiel referenced in healthcare information and activity.

**Intent**

Administer identifying and descriptive information about health materiel referenced in healthcare information and activity.

**Boundary**

Reference representation is distinct from procurement, manufacturing and prescribing.

## ARB identity continuity

Historical identity [9216f9cc905e4526b1d98cd4ab382cbf](9216f9cc905e4526b1d98cd4ab382cbf.md) has direct correspondence with this capability under HCRL 1.1.5-002. Historical provenance and UUID reservation remain with that record; this resource retains its existing identity and independent standing.</documentation>
