                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Eligibility &amp; Catchment Specification" id="id-c59136a64f975632934f7b398588f222" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Define clinical referral thresholds and geographic catchment boundaries.

Eligibility specification captures the clinical thresholds and geographical bounds applicable to service access. It provides the criteria context needed to consider a request without making publication of those criteria an individual eligibility decision or a completed allocation.</documentation>
