                    <documentation>Define temporal availability, clinic operating hours, and on-call service windows.

Operating schedules make temporal availability and exceptions explicit for a service. They distinguish an existing offering from one available at the relevant time, while leaving actual resource readiness and operational capacity as separate concerns.</documentation>
