                <folder name="II.1.3.4.4.1.3 [Feature] Service Catalogue Publishing" id="id-dc0bdbf07908461692408e705300d034">
                  <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.4.4.1.3. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=d397e670ae524f399e91176c64390fa7; Exchange identifier=id-084705bec7aa5d6aa377c16fcdc8d05c. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Service Catalogue Publishing" id="id-084705bec7aa5d6aa377c16fcdc8d05c" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Publish structured healthcare service definitions, clinical specialties, and intake criteria to regional directories.

Service catalogue publishing makes identifiable service definitions and intake context available to regional participants. A published service can be discovered as an offering rather than inferred from an organisation's name; publication alone does not establish present availability or collective readiness.</documentation>
