                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[CT3] Healthcare Service Profile Administration" id="id-9c7e5f6635095618a9fb1650dc184c64">
                  <documentation>Administer service definitions, provision relationships, defined availability and eligibility information describing offered healthcare services.

**Overview**

Administer service definitions, provision relationships, defined availability and eligibility information describing offered healthcare services.

**Intent**

Administer service definitions, provision relationships, defined availability and eligibility information describing offered healthcare services.

**Boundary**

Defined availability is not dynamic operational capacity, collective readiness or authority to accept clinical care.

## ARB identity continuity

Historical identity [7780ca2fed2346439d5f559d00cc4ee4](7780ca2fed2346439d5f559d00cc4ee4.md) has direct correspondence with this capability under HCRL 1.1.5-002. Historical provenance and UUID reservation remain with that record; this resource retains its existing identity and independent standing.</documentation>
