              <folder name="II.1.3.4.4.4 [CT3] Service Provision Relationship [superseded]" id="id-a5795b4a2b6344508e1adc6b3bdd5f6e">
                <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.4.4.4. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=718ebe1fa8d44ad9a6632a5932277a8e; Exchange identifier=id-3006d0eeedfd5899af44611e8fbda5b4. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[CT3] Service Provision Relationship" id="id-3006d0eeedfd5899af44611e8fbda5b4">
                  <documentation>Binding health services to specific organizations, locations, and practitioner roles.

**Overview**

Service provision joins a named offering to the organisations, places and practitioner roles through which it is provided. The mapping is the owned concern; the identity and meaning of each mapped participant remain with its established capability.

**Intent**

Make it clear which provider delivers which service at which place and through which participating roles.

**Boundary**

Owns mapping associations, retaining the owners of each participating entity.</documentation>
