                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[CT3] Healthcare Location Profile Administration" id="id-bc2bc98a7a495b47bf11db08e9c29bae">
                  <documentation>Administer the identity, address, geospatial description and physical containment relationships of healthcare locations.

**Overview**

Administer the identity, address, geospatial description and physical containment relationships of healthcare locations.

**Intent**

Administer the identity, address, geospatial description and physical containment relationships of healthcare locations.

**Boundary**

Location description does not establish occupancy, cleanliness, service capacity or service readiness.

## ARB identity continuity

Historical identity [8a04d1f16d0849e786d2aaec33e0ba87](8a04d1f16d0849e786d2aaec33e0ba87.md) has direct correspondence with this capability under HCRL 1.1.5-002. Historical provenance and UUID reservation remain with that record; this resource retains its existing identity and independent standing.</documentation>
