                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[CT3] Location Structure" id="id-8a82a7c44c7d573786cf4d00508d9941">
                  <documentation>Modeling the physical architecture of healthcare campuses.

**Overview**

Campus, building, floor, ward and room relationships explain physical containment. The structure provides navigation and context without determining organisational reporting lines or current operational capacity.

**Intent**

Allow a particular place to be interpreted within its physical surroundings.

**Boundary**

Physical containment differs from organisational structure and operational responsibility.</documentation>
