## ARB identity continuity

Historical identity [d412aff3a5c64e6aaba910d4c2c9356d](d412aff3a5c64e6aaba910d4c2c9356d.md) has direct correspondence with this capability under HCRL 1.1.5-002. Historical provenance and UUID reservation remain with that record; this resource retains its existing identity and independent standing.

## ARB source correspondence

Scope/anti-responsibility and clinical/operational meaning establish the responsible Capability; descriptive ledger/registry/asset labels do not establish a separately bounded formal Information Concept. Preserve non-transfer and source authority.

Source: `docs/markdown/03-business-architecture/information-responsibility/information-responsibility.md` — information responsibility row 7. Standing: Established Business responsibility only; formal information identity/lifecycle not inferred.

```text
| **Location Administration** | **Location &amp; Care-Place Definitions** | Physical sites, campuses, buildings, floors, wards, rooms, bays, and structural care-place specifications (bed bay infrastructure, gas outlets, physical telemetry wiring). | Does not own operational occupancy, cleaning state, or bed turnover workflows. |
```</documentation>
