                <folder name="II.1.3.4.6.1.3 [Feature] National Organisation Verification" id="id-e84df2e88eb34b6db5db14eadded2f6b">
                  <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.4.6.1.3. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=0f17fe5439fe45dc8f4edbff3cca0776; Exchange identifier=id-cf983a3e0da35a50a06f2e8c3d7e5f2d. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] National Organisation Verification" id="id-cf983a3e0da35a50a06f2e8c3d7e5f2d" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Validate national organization identifiers (e.g., HPI-O) and legal entity classifications.

National organisation verification grounds an organisation identifier and entity classification in their recognised context. This supports reliable interpretation of the healthcare participant without assuming that its identity establishes every service, location or authority associated with it.</documentation>
