                <folder name="II.1.3.4.6.1.4 [Feature] Organisation Profile Management" id="id-0487a856a608478aa01fef428ac9285a">
                  <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.4.6.1.4. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=6a4c44cfb1414f3bae5ba0fce1e58970; Exchange identifier=id-f15b1ca5af8f5d329e4351c717508eff. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Organisation Profile Management" id="id-f15b1ca5af8f5d329e4351c717508eff" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Govern directory profiles, operational status, and published service descriptions.

Organisation profiles provide a governed account of the participant's status and published service descriptions. They support consistent directory use across systems while leaving the organisation's real-world governance and the definition of individual offerings distinguishable.</documentation>
