                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[CT3] Healthcare Organisation Profile Administration" id="id-4bd6510c5dc5510291b60560f6e68b71">
                  <documentation>Administer identifying, descriptive, structural, location, contact, registered/legal and recognised endpoint information needed to represent and interact with a healthcare organisation.

**Overview**

Administer identifying, descriptive, structural, location, contact, registered/legal and recognised endpoint information needed to represent and interact with a healthcare organisation.

**Intent**

Administer identifying, descriptive, structural, location, contact, registered/legal and recognised endpoint information needed to represent and interact with a healthcare organisation.

**Boundary**

Maintains verified legal and operational identity information without corporate management authority.

## ARB identity continuity

Historical identity [e485424b799c42aca7399d341ca02d0b](e485424b799c42aca7399d341ca02d0b.md) has direct correspondence with this capability under HCRL 1.1.5-002. Historical provenance and UUID reservation remain with that record; this resource retains its existing identity and independent standing.</documentation>
