## ARB identity continuity

Historical identity [1b0eacfbb27d4631a24f9279dab6681d](1b0eacfbb27d4631a24f9279dab6681d.md) has direct correspondence with this capability under HCRL 1.1.5-002. Historical provenance and UUID reservation remain with that record; this resource retains its existing identity and independent standing.

## ARB source correspondence

Scope/anti-responsibility and clinical/operational meaning establish the responsible Capability; descriptive ledger/registry/asset labels do not establish a separately bounded formal Information Concept. Preserve non-transfer and source authority.

Source: `docs/markdown/03-business-architecture/information-responsibility/information-responsibility.md` — information responsibility row 6. Standing: Established Business responsibility only; formal information identity/lifecycle not inferred.

```text
| **Organisation Administration** | **Healthcare Organisation Registry** | Enterprise legal identities, national facility identifiers (HPI-O), accreditation status, organisational hierarchy trees (directorates/departments), and official facility contacts. | Does not own physical location geospatial data. |
```</documentation>
