                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Practitioner Profile Governance" id="id-99fd4d1c8c21544cadf1ae4735acd6ca" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Maintain core professional demographic details, qualifications, and active practice status.

Practitioner profile governance maintains the professional context used across care information and communication. Qualifications and practice status remain attributable facts, distinct from the organisation-specific role or privilege under which the practitioner may act.</documentation>
