                  <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.4.7.1.3. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=cd3bd35f7f9e4852bbbce299bb795d8a; Exchange identifier=id-523ec46acc27554ab7706bf0c6ed45b6. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Provider Directory Discovery &amp; Resolution" id="id-523ec46acc27554ab7706bf0c6ed45b6" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Expose qualified practitioner discovery using identifiers, profile criteria and effective standing.

**Overview**

Routing and care participation need to find a described provider matching stated criteria, beyond merely ingesting a national identifier or updating a profile.

**Boundary**

Discovery supplies information; it does not determine privilege or availability.</documentation>
