                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[CT3] Practitioner Profile Administration" id="id-4c6e206c1684595b84981d627a110e53">
                  <documentation>Administer practitioner identity, professional profile and supplied registration information with its issuing-authority attribution.

**Overview**

Administer practitioner identity, professional profile and supplied registration information with its issuing-authority attribution.

**Intent**

Administer practitioner identity, professional profile and supplied registration information with its issuing-authority attribution.

**Boundary**

Professional registration and profile representation do not grant clinical or operational privilege.

## ARB identity continuity

Historical identity [2415ddcbc73c47e1a63be310bd4342ee](2415ddcbc73c47e1a63be310bd4342ee.md) has direct correspondence with this capability under HCRL 1.1.5-002. Historical provenance and UUID reservation remain with that record; this resource retains its existing identity and independent standing.</documentation>
