                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[CT3] Provider Relationship" id="id-706567fdfba05959be6ac7247ad0480e">
                  <documentation>Managing organizational affiliations and multidisciplinary team relationships.

**Overview**

Effective affiliations explain which practitioner or team participates with which organisation. These relationships support collaboration and routing while each participating identity keeps its own responsibility owner.

**Intent**

Preserve which affiliations apply when interpreting provider participation.

**Boundary**

Affiliation records do not transfer the participating organisations or practitioner identities to this capability.</documentation>
