                <documentation>Establish and curate governed data assets suitable for explicitly authorised research use, retaining source attribution and applicable release constraints.

**Overview**

Establish and curate governed data assets suitable for explicitly authorised research use, retaining source attribution and applicable release constraints.

**Intent**

Establish and curate governed data assets suitable for explicitly authorised research use, retaining source attribution and applicable release constraints.

**Boundary**

Does not grant ethics approval, recruit trial participants, manage trials or become the authority for derived research conclusions.

## ARB identity continuity

Historical identity [11203b9c80964a9b96883eeab07f41d5](11203b9c80964a9b96883eeab07f41d5.md) has direct correspondence with this capability under HCRL 1.1.5-002. Historical provenance and UUID reservation remain with that record; this resource retains its existing identity and independent standing.</documentation>
