              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[CT2] Service Planning Data Management" id="id-95802b6c6b505351b4d3d57f8aed2753">
                <documentation>Establish and maintain governed information assets suitable for health-service planning, modelling and analysis.

**Overview**

Establish and maintain governed information assets suitable for health-service planning, modelling and analysis.

**Intent**

Establish and maintain governed information assets suitable for health-service planning, modelling and analysis.

**Boundary**

Observed utilisation, operational capacity and planned capacity are distinct; information provision does not commission services or allocate resources.

## ARB identity continuity

Historical identity [19263e0802cc4b88af7a345f1410cffd](19263e0802cc4b88af7a345f1410cffd.md) has direct correspondence with this capability under HCRL 1.1.5-002. Historical provenance and UUID reservation remain with that record; this resource retains its existing identity and independent standing.</documentation>
