            <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[CT1] Health Informatics Management" id="id-dc7f84d80543529cab8e2ccc86a0428c">
              <documentation>Establish and govern semantically meaningful health-information assets suitable for downstream research, population-health reporting and service planning in an adjacent analytical environment.

**Overview**

Establish and govern semantically meaningful health-information assets suitable for downstream research, population-health reporting and service planning in an adjacent analytical environment.

**Intent**

Establish and govern semantically meaningful health-information assets suitable for downstream research, population-health reporting and service planning in an adjacent analytical environment.

**Boundary**

Harmonia is adjacent to a Big Data/analytical environment. It establishes governed assets and reporting inputs; it does not become that analytical platform.

## ARB identity continuity

Historical identity [50c56bac0dc540a2b392fc2376efc129](50c56bac0dc540a2b392fc2376efc129.md) has direct correspondence with this capability under HCRL 1.1.5-002. Historical provenance and UUID reservation remain with that record; this resource retains its existing identity and independent standing.</documentation>
