                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[CT3] Bed &amp; Care-Place State Administration" id="id-315b46c620d151868c9f84a0ed45ccd2">
                  <documentation>Administer the current operational occupancy, reservation, blocking and readiness states of beds and other care-places.

**Overview**

Administer the current operational occupancy, reservation, blocking and readiness states of beds and other care-places. The reviewed hierarchy assigns this enduring ability to its stated business-enabling context.

**Intent**

Administer the current operational occupancy, reservation, blocking and readiness states of beds and other care-places.

**Boundary**

Information administration and coordination preserve the authority of the responsible source, clinical actor and governed domain; they confer no additional real-world management authority.

## ARB identity continuity

Historical identity [dd2e2ee1a68845c087ba93610752181b](dd2e2ee1a68845c087ba93610752181b.md) has direct correspondence with this capability under HCRL 1.1.5-002. Historical provenance and UUID reservation remain with that record; this resource retains its existing identity and independent standing.</documentation>
