                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Bed Readiness Notification" id="id-62b06ad8a1485803984649065d4b2b5b" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Notify bed allocation managers and clinical units when a cleaned bed achieves READY status.

Readiness notification exposes the established readiness of a care place to the responsible allocation participants. It makes a relevant transition actionable without deciding the clinical suitability of the next allocation or establishing whole-service readiness.</documentation>
