                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[CT3] Bed &amp; Care-Place Turnover Coordination" id="id-f498770b9a45551990afc0c14336212f">
                  <documentation>Coordinate the operational transition of a released care-place through cleaning, preparation and readiness notifications.

**Overview**

Coordinate the operational transition of a released care-place through cleaning, preparation and readiness notifications. The reviewed hierarchy assigns this enduring ability to its stated business-enabling context.

**Intent**

Coordinate the operational transition of a released care-place through cleaning, preparation and readiness notifications.

**Boundary**

Information administration and coordination preserve the authority of the responsible source, clinical actor and governed domain; they confer no additional real-world management authority.

## ARB identity continuity

Historical identity [a50662edda954bc58c44184d84591d5b](a50662edda954bc58c44184d84591d5b.md) has direct correspondence with this capability under HCRL 1.1.5-002. Historical provenance and UUID reservation remain with that record; this resource retains its existing identity and independent standing.</documentation>
