## ARB identity continuity

Historical identity [c94d29b7d1c045dabc7814ceea795484](c94d29b7d1c045dabc7814ceea795484.md) has direct correspondence with this capability under HCRL 1.1.5-002. Historical provenance and UUID reservation remain with that record; this resource retains its existing identity and independent standing.

## ARB source correspondence

Scope/anti-responsibility and clinical/operational meaning establish the responsible Capability; descriptive ledger/registry/asset labels do not establish a separately bounded formal Information Concept. Preserve non-transfer and source authority.

Source: `docs/markdown/03-business-architecture/information-responsibility/information-responsibility.md` — information responsibility row 22. Standing: Established Business responsibility only; formal information identity/lifecycle not inferred.

```text
| **Bed &amp; Care-Place Management** | **Operational Bed State &amp; Turnover Ledger** | Real-time bed occupancy status (*Available*, *Occupied*, *Cleaning*, *Locked*), environmental locks, turnover milestone logs, and cleaning verification timestamps. | Does not own static physical care-place definitions or establish Ward capacity; an available bed alone is insufficient. |
```</documentation>
