              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[CT2] Care Movement &amp; Transition Coordination" id="id-f460240046915af4a9f9a081c5593b1c">
                <documentation>Coordinate movement of people/materials and operational departure readiness across care boundaries.

**Overview**

Coordinate movement of people/materials and operational departure readiness across care boundaries. Its constituent abilities distinguish Patient Transport; Clinical Logistics Coordination; Discharge Management.

**Intent**

Coordinate the operational prerequisites and observed milestones of movement and departure without assuming clinical clearance.

**Boundary**

Physical movement, clinical handover, discharge clinical authorisation and care-responsibility transition remain distinct.</documentation>
