 Service Capacity Management consumes/coordinates those capacity states; Work Allocation &amp; Dispatch and Discharge Management may consume them without acquiring their ownership. Exact provider contracts remain unestablished.&quot;}],&quot;method&quot;:&quot;AI architectural synthesis under the explicitly authorised Step 2 task&quot;}"/>
