            <folder name="II.1.3.6.4 [CT2] Care Setting Operations Enablement [superseded]" id="id-ba2661552d4b44c5b3c61a5e2797f147">
              <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.6.4. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=a03741e6e98642bea44680d23fdcb434; Exchange identifier=id-0aca1a5cceb9581a85904af01a3591e3. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[CT2] Care Setting Operations Enablement" id="id-0aca1a5cceb9581a85904af01a3591e3">
                <documentation>Coordinate the local flow, session state and capacity semantics of a care-delivery setting.

**Overview**

Coordinate the local flow, session state and capacity semantics of a care-delivery setting. Its constituent abilities distinguish Clinic &amp; Practice Operations; Ward Operations; Theatre Operations; Emergency Department Operations; Outpatient Operations.

**Intent**

Express the actual operating constraints of each setting rather than substituting a generic resource count for capacity.

**Boundary**

Local capacity is established here; aggregate telemetry, bed state and equipment state cannot substitute for it.</documentation>
