                <folder name="II.1.3.6.5.1.2 [Feature] Clinic Session Tracking" id="id-99d2a5bbf16b469da4e27bbe826dbcc1">
                  <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.6.5.1.2. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=03e185a6e0d145c3975b3f4715c94207; Exchange identifier=id-8255e836d9cf51158e21e8a35b81848e. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Clinic Session Tracking" id="id-8255e836d9cf51158e21e8a35b81848e" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Ingest and track clinic operating session start, delay, and completion states.

Clinic-session tracking records the operating session's start, delay and completion as service-level context. It is distinct from an individual patient's queue state: knowing where one patient is waiting does not establish whether the clinic session is running as planned.</documentation>
