                <folder name="II.1.3.6.5.1.3 [Feature] Operational Queue Progression" id="id-19e63527b06b4dbe8d23cb3d04222f32">
                  <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.6.5.1.3. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=5852c7d4c9ac4bbf99e7df008d0ed770; Exchange identifier=id-b86cb7ff593057368b07a7f7c77cddc7. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Operational Queue Progression" id="id-b86cb7ff593057368b07a7f7c77cddc7" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Track client queue progression through reception, waiting area, consultation, and billing.

Operational queue progression makes the patient's passage through clinic stages visible. The queue concerns real-world arrival, waiting and consultation context, rather than a broker queue, and does not give Harmonia authority to determine clinical priority or own the clinician's worklist.</documentation>
                    <property key="v0.2 / Source Capture Key" value="feature:operational-queue-progression"/>
