                  <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.6.7.2.1. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=34f182cfc6b945d090a880943bbb4959; Exchange identifier=id-6df39c0df1365e7390f6d062c1cdb576. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Pathology Specimen Transport Tracking" id="id-6df39c0df1365e7390f6d062c1cdb576" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Track pickup, custody chain, transport conditions, and laboratory delivery of clinical specimens.

Specimen transport tracking retains pickup, custody and condition context through laboratory delivery. It supports interpretation of the material's journey without treating a delivered package as proof of specimen suitability, completed analysis or an authorised diagnostic report.</documentation>
