                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[CT3] Organisation Clinical Certification &amp; Compliance Support" id="id-5ae6f84e6e865ab78d46b5a33357cb9d">
                  <documentation>Administer supplied organisation clinical certification and conformance evidence for use in service qualification and participation.

**Overview**

Administer supplied organisation clinical certification and conformance evidence for use in service qualification and participation. The reviewed hierarchy assigns this enduring ability to its stated business-enabling context.

**Intent**

Administer supplied organisation clinical certification and conformance evidence for use in service qualification and participation.

**Boundary**

Information administration and coordination preserve the authority of the responsible source, clinical actor and governed domain; they confer no additional real-world management authority.

## ARB identity continuity

Historical identity [cee76a930a4e4e7d9c49357ba290c8bf](cee76a930a4e4e7d9c49357ba290c8bf.md) has direct correspondence with this capability under HCRL 1.1.5-002. Historical provenance and UUID reservation remain with that record; this resource retains its existing identity and independent standing.</documentation>
