                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Clinical Privileging Record" id="id-9806bb0b0d5b56b1b8ce353774a0e579" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Track active clinical admitting and practice privileges within healthcare facilities.

The privileging record makes applicable admitting and practice permissions available as contextual evidence. It represents the health service's established privilege standing rather than granting new authority merely because a record exists in the directory.</documentation>
