                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[CT3] Clinical Roster Capture &amp; Communication" id="id-50bd81c2c0425bbba29347b0aeb4025a">
                  <documentation>Capture and communicate supplied clinical roster information, its effective periods and subsequent coverage changes.

**Overview**

Capture and communicate supplied clinical roster information, its effective periods and subsequent coverage changes. The reviewed hierarchy assigns this enduring ability to its stated business-enabling context.

**Intent**

Capture and communicate supplied clinical roster information, its effective periods and subsequent coverage changes.

**Boundary**

Information administration and coordination preserve the authority of the responsible source, clinical actor and governed domain; they confer no additional real-world management authority.

## ARB identity continuity

Historical identity [2054d57bb33a4361b3ef0824545a1784](2054d57bb33a4361b3ef0824545a1784.md) has direct correspondence with this capability under HCRL 1.1.5-002. Historical provenance and UUID reservation remain with that record; this resource retains its existing identity and independent standing.</documentation>
