                    <documentation>Track clinical criteria-led discharge milestones (medications dispensed, transportation arranged, home care confirmed).

Discharge milestone tracking records confirmations contributed by the relevant clinical and operational participants. It makes outstanding requirements visible without allowing the tracking mechanism to declare clinical readiness or assume that every local milestone defines a universal discharge pathway.</documentation>
