                <folder name="II.1.3.6.14.1.2 [Feature] Discharge Notification Dispatch" id="id-4b4dc759cbfb42a7b45fb330e82934cc">
                  <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.6.14.1.2. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=5476307ca5a34590aa7025ab59ca0c10; Exchange identifier=id-5dcf4908977755da9d9d24634c06a74e. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Discharge Notification Dispatch" id="id-5dcf4908977755da9d9d24634c06a74e" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Dispatch departure notifications, updated bed states, and finalized discharge summaries to external care providers upon physical patient exit.

Departure notification communicates the physical exit and associated record and place-state context to the applicable participants. It distinguishes departure information from earlier readiness and from the clinical decision, while retaining the separate question of responsibility actually assumed elsewhere.</documentation>
