                <folder name="II.1.3.6.14.1.3 [Feature] Discharge Readiness &amp; Coordination Oversight" id="id-1b278b2bc65a41ff885a4f44b1e08429">
                  <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.6.14.1.3. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=5499422ed3644e0bbf7645f9ae3f20cb; Exchange identifier=id-ad709cdc9a7859a6ae8f274f7f04a76c. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Discharge Readiness &amp; Coordination Oversight" id="id-ad709cdc9a7859a6ae8f274f7f04a76c" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Track and aggregate multidisciplinary discharge milestones, home care confirmations, and transit readiness across care teams.

Readiness oversight brings multidisciplinary, home-care and transport confirmations into one coordination view. Aggregation supports the responsible participants' decisions but does not itself confer authority to discharge or establish acceptance of continuing care by another provider.</documentation>
                    <property key="v0.2 / Source Capture Key" value="feature:discharge-readiness--coordination-oversight"/>
