                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] ED Bed &amp; Bay Tracking" id="id-5814dabf7ccf5b6d94b9dafc0e60bce1" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Track occupancy and status of emergency cubicles, resuscitation bays, and short-stay beds.

Emergency-place tracking distinguishes occupancy and status across cubicles, resuscitation bays and short-stay beds. It provides place context for departmental operations while leaving the service's usable capacity and clinical triage decisions separate from an inventory of spaces.</documentation>
