                <folder name="II.1.3.6.15.2.2 [Feature] ED Length of Stay Tracking" id="id-2f3ce3b7032f47fd9aa7743e720b7746">
                  <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.6.15.2.2. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=e544f3d76db84dfaad57880d13a873c4; Exchange identifier=id-39515750d91154fd8d37227f3bae2ae5. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] ED Length of Stay Tracking" id="id-39515750d91154fd8d37227f3bae2ae5" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Monitor operational wait times and length-of-stay milestones, generating operational escalation notifications.

Length-of-stay tracking makes waits and operational timing thresholds visible for escalation. The timing information supports management of impediments without determining clinical urgency or making an elapsed-time alert an independent assurance finding.</documentation>
