                <folder name="II.1.3.6.15.2.3 [Feature] Emergency Treatment Capacity Management" id="id-b8fdc034e3cc4f7cb94c5facfaff2804">
                  <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.6.15.2.3. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=502876430cf747f4b3bb102fb69557a5; Exchange identifier=id-6f6d3ad191315cfe8532bafc91d8b022. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Emergency Treatment Capacity Management" id="id-6f6d3ad191315cfe8532bafc91d8b022" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Represent current emergency treatment capacity under space, staffing and acuity constraints.

**Overview**

Bay state and length of stay contribute evidence but do not alone establish the ability to accept another care demand.

**Boundary**

Local responsibility retains its capacity meaning; Service Capacity Management consumes it without acquiring ownership or imposing one common capacity model.</documentation>
                    <property key="v0.2 / Source Capture Key" value="proposal:feature-emergency-treatment-capacity-management"/>
                    <property key="v0.2 / Snapshot Reference ID" value="HCM-FT-emergency-treatment-capacity-management"/>
                    <property key="v0.2 / LaTeX Label" value="feature:emergency-treatment-capacity-management"/>
                    <property key="v0.2 / Construct Type" value="feature"/>
                    <property key="v0.2 / Capability Tier" value="FT"/>
                    <property key="v0.2 / Architectural Status" value="Proposed"/>
                    <property key="v0.2 / Record State" value="current"/>
                    <property key="v0.2 / Placement Status" value="Proposed"/>
                    <property key="v0.2 / Structural ID Status" value="Proposed"/>
                    <property key="v0.2 / Structural Canonical ID" value="CT1-BEC-CARE-OPERATIONS-COORDINATION-ENABLEMENT.CT2-BEC-EMERGENCY-DEPARTMENT-OPERATIONS.CT3-BEC-EMERGENCY-DEPARTMENT-OPERATIONAL-COORDINATION.FEAT-STEP2-EMERGENCY-TREATMENT-CAPACITY-MANAGEMENT"/>
                    <property key="v0.2 / Historical ID Aliases" value="[&quot;CT1-BEC-CARE-OPERATIONS-COORDINATION-ENABLEMENT.CT2-BEC-CARE-SETTING-OPERATIONS-ENABLEMENT.CT3-BEC-EMERGENCY-DEPARTMENT-OPERATIONS.FEAT-STEP2-EMERGENCY-TREATMENT-CAPACITY-MANAGEMENT&quot;]"/>
                    <property key="v0.2 / Name Status" value="Proposed"/>
                    <property key="v0.2 / Architecture Identity Status" value="Unresolved — representation ID only"/>
                    <property key="v0.2 / Derivation Provenance" value="{&quot;authority&quot;:&quot;Proposed only; cited source standing is not inherited&quot;,&quot;derivation&quot;:&quot;Inferred from capability-specific behaviour, v0.3 inspection and current architectural evidence&quot;,&quot;evidence&quot;:[{&quot;line&quot;:34,&quot;path&quot;:&quot;docs/markdown/03-business-architecture/information-responsibility/information-responsibility.md&quot;,&quot;standing&quot;:&quot;Current corpus evidence; does not promote the derived assertion&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;[Context-specific Capacity Management](../behaviours/04-health-service-operations.md#capacity-management-responsibility-boundary) establishes/manages capacity meaning for Clinic &amp; Practice Operations, Ward Operations, Theatre Operations, Emergency Department Operations, Outpatient Operations and Mobile Staff Management. Their local information responsibilities express available, committed and utilised capacity without prescribing a shared formal Information Object or identical model. Bed/care-place and equipment state contribute; they do not alone establish service capacity. Service Capacity Management consumes/coordinates those capacity states; Work Allocation &amp; Dispatch and Discharge Management may consume them without acquiring their ownership. Exact provider contracts remain unestablished.&quot;}],&quot;method&quot;:&quot;AI architectural synthesis under the explicitly authorised Step 2 task&quot;}"/>
