                <folder name="II.1.3.6.16.1.2 [Feature] Mobile Visit Status Tracking" id="id-7a1179c47059401abffd08671f612b96">
                  <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.6.16.1.2. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=3cd49cb00159437ea25048c1158172c1; Exchange identifier=id-cc03161ecba65ae09e77504b684c45e4. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Mobile Visit Status Tracking" id="id-cc03161ecba65ae09e77504b684c45e4" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Ingest arrival, visit progression, and safety check-in milestones from roving staff.

Mobile visit tracking receives arrival, progression and safety checkpoints from roving workers. It makes reported activity visible in the wider operational context without originating the clinical visit, deciding its clinical content or assuming that a checkpoint proves the intended clinical outcome.</documentation>
