                <folder name="II.1.3.6.16.1.3 [Feature] Mobile Worker Task Dispatch" id="id-96ef933e618c43c4a8057cf9b5df96d2">
                  <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.6.16.1.3. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=426363f2f02a4625a4feab89a2adc755; Exchange identifier=id-2bc2b73b45f85084a790267351edc65b. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Mobile Worker Task Dispatch" id="id-2bc2b73b45f85084a790267351edc65b" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Dispatch community care tasks and urgent visits to roving clinicians' mobile devices.

Mobile dispatch exchanges externally established assignment, dispatch and progression information with business mobile-work mechanisms. The retained name does not grant Harmonia authority to allocate clinical work, manage handover or own EMR worklists, and external task terminology does not redefine Synthetic Task.

**Boundary**

The proposed replacement name remains unconfirmed. This entry preserves the existing identity and the human-adjudicated integration boundary.</documentation>
