                  <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.6.17.1.1. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=b588f3cc869d460a9561657352fb189a; Exchange identifier=id-dd333265394a581797c0d16c50ed3f96. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Active On-Call Provider Resolution" id="id-dd333265394a581797c0d16c50ed3f96" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Resolve currently active on-call specialists, registrars, and operational managers for a given specialty and hospital at any point in time.

Active on-call resolution identifies the current provider in the required specialty and hospital context. It supports correct routing at the relevant time without authoring the roster or treating current coverage as proof of qualification, privilege or responsibility acceptance.</documentation>
