                <folder name="II.1.3.6.19.1.1 [Feature] Outpatient Appointment Capacity Management" id="id-f72e68f9ce064c2ba02c4889bf4985f5">
                  <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.6.19.1.1. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=3c4f8b0fc23044cbbac32602e1272680; Exchange identifier=id-e7edec60d944543494e6f3b42c7bf82e. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Outpatient Appointment Capacity Management" id="id-e7edec60d944543494e6f3b42c7bf82e" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Represent usable outpatient session capacity from booking, staffing and local flow information.

**Overview**

The projection distinguishes scheduled slots from currently usable care capacity without taking source booking authority.

**Boundary**

Local responsibility retains its capacity meaning; Service Capacity Management consumes it without acquiring ownership or imposing one common capacity model.</documentation>
                    <property key="v0.2 / Source Capture Key" value="proposal:feature-outpatient-appointment-capacity-management"/>
