                <folder name="II.1.3.6.19.1.2 [Feature] Outpatient Arrival Registration" id="id-b1043e83dd77430ba61b202c6368b359">
                  <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.6.19.1.2. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=4ea71fb4950848cfb4f6d916190edad0; Exchange identifier=id-b041f0650c57509fa5628fb8fb3bbc7e. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Outpatient Arrival Registration" id="id-b041f0650c57509fa5628fb8fb3bbc7e" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Ingest self-service check-in and clinic arrival events, notifying treating clinicians.

Outpatient arrival registration connects a check-in event with the treating context and required notification. Approved reusable composition supplies this integration responsibility; it does not require a specialised arrival Function or prove that a consultation has begun or finished.</documentation>
