                  <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.6.20.1.1. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=d8ef9994298f466bafce919c5e6cb701; Exchange identifier=id-e4b9833e869b5bb0b75a7d3a05960b80. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Transport Dispatch &amp; Progress Tracking" id="id-e4b9833e869b5bb0b75a7d3a05960b80" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Dispatch transport orders, tracking departure, transit, and destination arrival checkpoints.

Transport progression connects dispatch, departure, transit and arrival evidence for a physical patient journey. The checkpoints make movement intelligible while preserving that reaching a destination does not establish clinical handover or assumption of responsibility there.</documentation>
