                <folder name="II.1.3.6.23.1.3 [Feature] Theatre Session Capacity Management" id="id-6c5d7e61fddb44a79f6c468837ff4548">
                  <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.6.23.1.3. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=258c27077caf4bf88e562e8dd607bdfd; Exchange identifier=id-2047568070c354a381514a23e44cd763. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Theatre Session Capacity Management" id="id-2047568070c354a381514a23e44cd763" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Represent available and committed procedural-session capacity with its resource dependencies.

**Overview**

Theatre capacity involves session time, team capability, equipment and recovery provision rather than a count of theatres.

**Boundary**

Local responsibility retains its capacity meaning; Service Capacity Management consumes it without acquiring ownership or imposing one common capacity model.</documentation>
