                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[CT3] Perioperative Logistics Coordination" id="id-0df9d488a0865c958bf5b6c3557b8976">
                  <documentation>Coordinate theatre case progression information and notifications to supporting perioperative operational teams.

**Overview**

Coordinate theatre case progression information and notifications to supporting perioperative operational teams. The reviewed hierarchy assigns this enduring ability to its stated business-enabling context.

**Intent**

Coordinate theatre case progression information and notifications to supporting perioperative operational teams.

**Boundary**

Information administration and coordination preserve the authority of the responsible source, clinical actor and governed domain; they confer no additional real-world management authority.

## ARB identity continuity

Historical identity [e7813a06b9df462fa135c299261f192e](e7813a06b9df462fa135c299261f192e.md) has direct correspondence with this capability under HCRL 1.1.5-002. Historical provenance and UUID reservation remain with that record; this resource retains its existing identity and independent standing.</documentation>
