                  <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.6.25.1.1. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=095826f788b64784af38af31bbe77105; Exchange identifier=id-f3c15ee52d2b5309a14fbf7087a99688. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Work Dispatch Delivery" id="id-f3c15ee52d2b5309a14fbf7087a99688" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Deliver work orders to target workers, devices, or team queues with technical and operational acknowledgement capture.

Dispatch delivery brings assigned operational work to the intended worker or team and retains acknowledgement evidence. Technical receipt and operational acknowledgement must remain distinguishable; neither alone proves that the work was performed or its intended outcome achieved.</documentation>
