                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[CT3] Operational Work Assignment &amp; Dispatch Coordination" id="id-b4d502174176517d89e42e4cd48e1fff">
                  <documentation>Coordinate qualified operational work assignment, dispatch, acknowledgement, progression and escalation within assigned authority.

**Overview**

Coordinate qualified operational work assignment, dispatch, acknowledgement, progression and escalation within assigned authority. The reviewed hierarchy assigns this enduring ability to its stated business-enabling context.

**Intent**

Coordinate qualified operational work assignment, dispatch, acknowledgement, progression and escalation within assigned authority.

**Boundary**

Information administration and coordination preserve the authority of the responsible source, clinical actor and governed domain; they confer no additional real-world management authority.

## ARB identity continuity

Historical identity [b42afda9e876463ba56fa8f73fe7a32a](b42afda9e876463ba56fa8f73fe7a32a.md) has direct correspondence with this capability under HCRL 1.1.5-002. Historical provenance and UUID reservation remain with that record; this resource retains its existing identity and independent standing.</documentation>
