## ARB identity continuity

Historical identity [f8c13b6f74b840cc96fbeada5865455a](f8c13b6f74b840cc96fbeada5865455a.md) has direct correspondence with this capability under HCRL 1.1.5-002. Historical provenance and UUID reservation remain with that record; this resource retains its existing identity and independent standing.

## ARB source correspondence

Scope/anti-responsibility and clinical/operational meaning establish the responsible Capability; descriptive ledger/registry/asset labels do not establish a separately bounded formal Information Concept. Preserve non-transfer and source authority.

Source: `docs/markdown/03-business-architecture/information-responsibility/information-responsibility.md` — information responsibility row 23. Standing: Established Business responsibility only; formal information identity/lifecycle not inferred.

```text
| **Work Allocation &amp; Dispatch** | **Operational Work Dispatch &amp; Milestone Ledger** | Facility support work requests, portering/cleaning queues, non-clinical operational mobile worker assignments, and job progression milestone timestamps. | May consume capacity/availability; does not own context-specific capacity, underlying clinical work/assignments, clinical task review decisions or clinical orders. |
```</documentation>
