              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[CT2] Workforce Qualification &amp; Development Enablement" id="id-0be98fb67d425ecab44e20c991d19a01">
                <documentation>Represent learning, competence, professional-standing checks and separately governed operational access qualifications.

**Overview**

Represent learning, competence, professional-standing checks and separately governed operational access qualifications. Its constituent abilities distinguish Clinical Training &amp; Education; Clinical Competency Management; Clinical Qualification Management; Clinical Supervision; Credential Management.

**Intent**

Keep professional standing, competence, supervision and operational-access evidence distinguishable when work is considered.

**Boundary**

Clinical qualifications and physical badges remain distinct CT3 responsibilities. Representation or checking does not grant privilege or become an authentication provider.</documentation>
