            <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[CT1] Health Service Operations Enablement" id="id-7d2f4319495b59248bd13f7b256a1c32">
              <documentation>Enable health-service operations through information about flow, care-places, capacity, workforce capability, operational work, logistics and discharge progression.

**Overview**

Enable health-service operations through information about flow, care-places, capacity, workforce capability, operational work, logistics and discharge progression.

**Intent**

Enable health-service operations through information about flow, care-places, capacity, workforce capability, operational work, logistics and discharge progression.

**Boundary**

Coordination owns only explicitly assigned operational activity. It does not originate clinical clearance, determine clinical work or take workforce and resource governance from their sources.

## ARB identity continuity

Historical identity [a98424298dac46d8b2ddd109d928270a](a98424298dac46d8b2ddd109d928270a.md) has direct correspondence with this capability under HCRL 1.1.5-002. Historical provenance and UUID reservation remain with that record; this resource retains its existing identity and independent standing.</documentation>
