                <folder name="II.1.3.7.2.1.2 [Feature] Entity-Relative Activity Coordination" id="id-d86708dea1b14e82a28594090585c0ff">
                  <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.7.2.1.2. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=b9960d7de097464ea6de94929ca48c89; Exchange identifier=id-690bcf58be875ffc83126a9d288b2df5. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Entity-Relative Activity Coordination" id="id-690bcf58be875ffc83126a9d288b2df5" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Sequence applicable behaviours for an identifiable entity input while preserving its operational reference frame.

**Overview**

Interest matching can select multiple behaviours while the entity progresses one input at a time. Each behaviour uses a fresh managed information context.

**Boundary**

Fan-out is not concurrent execution; clinical decisions and originating information remain with their owners.</documentation>
                    <property key="v0.2 / Source Capture Key" value="proposal:feature-entity-relative-activity-coordination"/>
                    <property key="v0.2 / Snapshot Reference ID" value="HCM-FT-entity-relative-activity-coordination"/>
