                  <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.7.2.2.1. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=34c8309244c142ec8772dcbb11ecc4ef; Exchange identifier=id-339280e5161858089a433918445c4836. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Activity Outcome &amp; Continuation Rules" id="id-339280e5161858089a433918445c4836" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Define how output roles, expected outcomes and continuation conditions are interpreted for an undertaking.

**Overview**

An output may contribute to completion, subsequent activity or retained evidence under different rules. Those meanings need to be specified rather than inferred from a returned payload.

**Boundary**

Completion policy is not business outcome truth; uncertain effects remain explicit.</documentation>
