                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Operational Activity Context Definition" id="id-25d8c4b3871058aa99f090a7ee1e2231" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Define the anticipated information context and expected fulfilment basis of an operational undertaking.

**Overview**

Even a one-unit activity needs a declared information and outcome frame. The definition is separate from loading values or running the business logic.

**Boundary**

No dynamically invented resource set or orchestration engine is implied.</documentation>
