                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] To Do Decision &amp; Approval Coordination" id="id-522c663fad0151a597da85ce9ef313b7" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Coordinate human clinical review items, sign-offs, and approval workflows.

---

## History

### Feature Overview — predecessor explanation

To Do coordination supports human review, sign-off and decision activity. Its progression can expose whether the review item has been handled while leaving the meaning and authority of the professional or governance decision with the responsible participant.</documentation>
