                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Work Order Progression" id="id-c8c5184814d85707844e56c072d9459c" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Manage execution states and dispatch of human operational work orders.

---

## History

### Feature Overview — predecessor explanation

Work Order progression coordinates human operational doing as a distinct work meaning. Dispatch, acceptance and completion describe the undertaking without making the workflow engine the authority over clinical work or treating a receipt as performance.</documentation>
