                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Temporal Assurance Criteria Stewardship" id="id-e2307fc080bf598bb4a5d37d18533361" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Manage identifiable assurance criteria and their relevant temporal and version applicability.

**Overview**

Evidence must be evaluated against the criteria applicable to its purpose and time rather than an unqualified current rule.

**Boundary**

Criteria stewardship does not approve governing requirements or select a universal result taxonomy.</documentation>
