              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[CT2] Assurance Specification" id="id-e18e1674a30c5c97a40ef75faea25663">
                <documentation>Model how satisfaction will be assured and maintain applicable, temporally qualified criteria.

**Overview**

Model how satisfaction will be assured and maintain applicable, temporally qualified criteria.

**Intent**

Model how satisfaction will be assured and maintain applicable, temporally qualified criteria.

**Boundary**

Modelling and criteria stewardship do not approve governing requirements or perform independent conclusion-making.

## ARB identity continuity

Historical identity [8006ee0dd95f4d7fb1f408fa09b6ce19](8006ee0dd95f4d7fb1f408fa09b6ce19.md) has direct correspondence with this capability under HCRL 1.1.5-002. Historical provenance and UUID reservation remain with that record; this resource retains its existing identity and independent standing.</documentation>
