              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[CT2] Independent Assurance Evaluation Enablement" id="id-fe7ae69ddcf154af96952f3194f71c33">
                <documentation>Associate trustworthy evidence, assess it and adjudicate independently reportable findings about governed service behaviour.

**Overview**

Associate trustworthy evidence, assess it and adjudicate independently reportable findings about governed service behaviour. Its constituent abilities distinguish Governed Assurance.

**Intent**

Produce findings supported by applicable evidence and criteria while retaining inability to conclude.

**Boundary**

The subject can supply evidence but cannot control its conclusion. Evidence insufficiency remains distinct from execution uncertainty and clinical judgement.</documentation>
