                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Care-Team Clinical Collaboration Coordination" id="id-bdd04a66c8eb54d28f5861d4a750bedf" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Coordinate secure multidisciplinary clinical communication and consultation exchange bound to patient encounters or clinical topics.

Clinical collaboration coordination binds secure multidisciplinary exchange to the relevant encounter or clinical topic. It supports conversation among authorised participants without making discourse an authoritative observation or acquiring the clinical handover authority excluded by the metamodel.</documentation>
