                  <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.9.2.1.2. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=8e2a760f15bd454c8aba1526ee69740c; Exchange identifier=id-75a499a861ff5b1ba5293910bda53633. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Collaboration Interaction Capture Qualification" id="id-75a499a861ff5b1ba5293910bda53633" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Qualify when a defined collaboration interaction creates a new governed information or activity consequence.

**Overview**

A message may convey existing information or an explicit interaction may derive a new managed consequence. The distinction preserves collaboration-native records while routing governed consequences to their accountable responsibility.

**Boundary**

Conversation presence, display or read receipt does not itself make a clinical decision, approval or final record.</documentation>
