                <folder name="II.1.3.9.2.1.3 [Feature] In-Conversation LHR Query Resolution" id="id-280263e81cd24584aa4d4375f566aa8a">
                  <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.9.2.1.3. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=d4437b477aab42c79b5f45150c5d7f3f; Exchange identifier=id-07ba91e1f3105439b697ef7dbce26f82. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] In-Conversation LHR Query Resolution" id="id-07ba91e1f3105439b697ef7dbce26f82" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Resolve clinical data queries within an authorized collaboration context, presenting verified clinical summaries directly to care team members.

In-conversation query supplies governed clinical summaries within an authorised collaboration context. The convenience of retrieving information during discussion does not weaken consent or access controls, and displaying a summary does not promote the surrounding conversation into the clinical record.</documentation>
