                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Information Authority &amp; Source Standing Representation" id="id-15b2dbb248135673b3bfa3dbe53a03fc" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Attach and preserve qualified source-authority and credibility standing for managed assertions.

**Overview**

The user of an assertion needs to distinguish authoritative, informational and anecdotal standing even when each was technically valid and durably accepted.

**Boundary**

Authority classification is not a clinical truth judgement or a universal rule for choosing competing assertions.</documentation>
