              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[CT2] Clinical Information Stewardship Enablement" id="id-1b407e2fabba5fd2a45c73692a95d79b">
                <documentation>Maintain governed longitudinal synthesis and the associations needed to use its constituent clinical information safely.

**Overview**

Maintain governed longitudinal synthesis and the associations needed to use its constituent clinical information safely. Its constituent abilities distinguish Patient Clinical Record.

**Intent**

Make the integrated clinical account usable while keeping its source assertions and associated content attributable.

**Boundary**

The synthesis preserves what Harmonia received or managed without becoming the originator of the clinical facts.</documentation>
