                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[CT3] Clinical Knowledge Artefact Distribution Management" id="id-048fd66ba8095ee3bb759b0c89bdf32f">
                  <documentation>Manage distribution of governed clinical knowledge artefacts to intended consumers under their applicable use contracts.

**Overview**

Manage distribution of governed clinical knowledge artefacts to intended consumers under their applicable use contracts. The reviewed hierarchy assigns this enduring ability to its stated business-enabling context.

**Intent**

Manage distribution of governed clinical knowledge artefacts to intended consumers under their applicable use contracts.

**Boundary**

Information administration and coordination preserve the authority of the responsible source, clinical actor and governed domain; they confer no additional real-world management authority.

## ARB identity continuity

Historical identity [d81e0d6d76014066a682e3d9e03e5f8a](d81e0d6d76014066a682e3d9e03e5f8a.md) has direct correspondence with this capability under HCRL 1.1.5-002. Historical provenance and UUID reservation remain with that record; this resource retains its existing identity and independent standing.</documentation>
