                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[CT3] Clinical Knowledge Request Administration" id="id-59010f4f41df5e509a40226be95a123b">
                  <documentation>Administer clinical knowledge requests and their qualified resolution to applicable governed knowledge or reference content.

**Overview**

Administer clinical knowledge requests and their qualified resolution to applicable governed knowledge or reference content. The reviewed hierarchy assigns this enduring ability to its stated business-enabling context.

**Intent**

Administer clinical knowledge requests and their qualified resolution to applicable governed knowledge or reference content.

**Boundary**

Information administration and coordination preserve the authority of the responsible source, clinical actor and governed domain; they confer no additional real-world management authority.

## ARB identity continuity

Historical identity [eb370c01fbdb4d22956d97e9ecd74b57](eb370c01fbdb4d22956d97e9ecd74b57.md) has direct correspondence with this capability under HCRL 1.1.5-002. Historical provenance and UUID reservation remain with that record; this resource retains its existing identity and independent standing.</documentation>
