                  <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.9.4.3.1. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=89123c868b8a46c38800916110cd918d; Exchange identifier=id-a41954fb90ab5744a24d14428d45c29a. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Governed Dataset Content Revision" id="id-a41954fb90ab5744a24d14428d45c29a" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Review, accept and expose authorised changes to mutable reference content with effective revision standing.

**Overview**

A model definition can remain stable while approved terminology membership or mapping content changes. This Feature represents that operational governance without making every definition runtime mutable.

**Boundary**

Does not invent an approval authority or bypass normal durable establishment.</documentation>
