                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Operational Team Chat Enablement" id="id-47a6974fa53d5efdb0ec6a3f36f31d1c" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Provide secure instant messaging channels for departmental, administrative, and facility support staff.

