                  <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.9.6.1.1. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=a9f1d2100faa44beb69add62bb4f4b3f; Exchange identifier=id-05263c5deb1d5ddfb4cbca4fad307bbd. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Access-Controlled Information Filtering" id="id-05263c5deb1d5ddfb4cbca4fad307bbd" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Filter search results dynamically according to requesting user authorizations and patient consent directives.

Access-qualified filtering restricts the disclosed result to the verified caller's authority and applicable consent. The responsibility is more specific than retrieving a resource; the latter's shared owner and subject matter do not establish a Feature realisation relationship.</documentation>
