                  <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.9.6.1.2. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=cfcc4d64af434418a567ccf46d8052dd; Exchange identifier=id-7750de806a73576bba5905eebbc9d550. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Federated Clinical Query" id="id-7750de806a73576bba5905eebbc9d550" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Execute bounded, indexed queries across distributed clinical resources and directory graphs.

Federated query makes relevant clinical and directory information discoverable across distributed contexts using bounded criteria. Discovery is a governed information-access responsibility rather than authority to disclose every match or reinterpret the clinical meaning of the results.</documentation>
