                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[CT3] Patient Health Library Access" id="id-cb1d28c1e8135785a123e050fa77210a">
                  <documentation>Enable authorised patient access to appropriately governed health knowledge and library information.

**Overview**

Enable authorised patient access to appropriately governed health knowledge and library information. The reviewed hierarchy assigns this enduring ability to its stated business-enabling context.

**Intent**

Enable authorised patient access to appropriately governed health knowledge and library information.

**Boundary**

Information administration and coordination preserve the authority of the responsible source, clinical actor and governed domain; they confer no additional real-world management authority.

## ARB identity continuity

Historical identity [b132224cfa6f435f8f2a66a3878d6df6](b132224cfa6f435f8f2a66a3878d6df6.md) has direct correspondence with this capability under HCRL 1.1.5-002. Historical provenance and UUID reservation remain with that record; this resource retains its existing identity and independent standing.</documentation>
