                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Standards-Based Boundary Exchange" id="id-0a5c88a49f2a518ebcf9b6f0315c092d" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Provide standards-conformant boundary exchange for healthcare messaging and resource representations.

---

## History

### Feature Overview — predecessor explanation

Boundary exchange preserves the standards contract understood by the external participant. Harmonia's internal management metadata must not leak into that contract, and publication must construct an allowed external representation without destructively changing the internally managed information.</documentation>
