              <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[CT2] Health Information Connectivity Enablement" id="id-10a8917a66475db1b276741d0efd840f">
                <documentation>Make governed health information discoverable and exchangeable under explicit internal and external contracts.

**Overview**

Make governed health information discoverable and exchangeable under explicit internal and external contracts. Its constituent abilities distinguish Health Information Exchange; Health Information Access; Health Information Communication.

**Intent**

Let authorised participants find and exchange the information their contract permits.

**Boundary**

Query execution, transaction coordination and boundary protocol mediation are separate responsibilities; none transfers content ownership.</documentation>
