                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Health Information Access &amp; Consent Control" id="id-75e742fb555b5d699b57e2ffe2237290" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Evaluate patient consent preferences, practitioner authority boundaries, and access control policies for managed clinical records.

Access and consent control evaluates whether an information operation is legitimate in its practitioner, patient and purpose context. It supplies policy determinations consumed by access and presentation paths rather than allowing those consumers to establish authority from caller-supplied content.</documentation>
