                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[CT3] HIE Endpoint State Management" id="id-6a1c86bc579e59e5854aafb3ace5c01f">
                  <documentation>Manage recognised exchange endpoint registrations, operational standing and contract-qualified availability information.

**Overview**

Manage recognised exchange endpoint registrations, operational standing and contract-qualified availability information. The reviewed hierarchy assigns this enduring ability to its stated business-enabling context.

**Intent**

Manage recognised exchange endpoint registrations, operational standing and contract-qualified availability information.

**Boundary**

Information administration and coordination preserve the authority of the responsible source, clinical actor and governed domain; they confer no additional real-world management authority.

## ARB identity continuity

Historical identity [697de08ac49a4b7f8df7a1ed6f04210e](697de08ac49a4b7f8df7a1ed6f04210e.md) has evolved correspondence with this capability under HCRL 1.1.5-002. Historical provenance and UUID reservation remain with that record; this resource retains its existing identity and independent standing.</documentation>
