                <folder name="II.1.3.9.10.2.2 [Feature] Clinical Record Retrieval Mediation" id="id-3fceeaff2d554ecb9cba6623c4e4bf18">
                  <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.9.10.2.2. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=6f4a9c8f7916488bb0dd838ccccb1df4; Exchange identifier=id-013cb98a363e5db5a88c0f3425a5921c. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Clinical Record Retrieval Mediation" id="id-013cb98a363e5db5a88c0f3425a5921c" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Mediate query-based retrieval requests across external and internal repositories.

Retrieval mediation connects a request with information held in participating repositories. It makes distributed retrieval possible without transferring repository authority, acquiring the clinical payload or treating a resolvable request as automatic permission to disclose.</documentation>
