                <folder name="II.1.3.9.10.2.4 [Feature] Event-Driven Syndication" id="id-203592e0fb3e44e98da909901302cdd6">
                  <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.9.10.2.4. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=30bb720ed4e64a47a1fcf3be811c1931; Exchange identifier=id-800daf9a3a695e5ab10e449abc4b96bc. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Event-Driven Syndication" id="id-800daf9a3a695e5ab10e449abc4b96bc" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Publish clinical and directory change events to subscribed systems matching interest filters.

Syndication connects published changes with subscribers whose registered interests match them. It differs from named-recipient distribution in how consumers are selected, while retaining governed delivery and the distinction between notification and the subscriber's eventual business action.</documentation>
                    <property key="v0.2 / Source Capture Key" value="feature:event-driven-syndication"/>
                    <property key="v0.2 / Snapshot Reference ID" value="FEAT-ISE-07"/>
                    <property key="v0.2 / LaTeX Label" value="feature:feat-ise-07"/>
                    <property key="v0.2 / Construct Type" value="feature"/>
                    <property key="v0.2 / Capability Tier" value="FT"/>
                    <property key="v0.2 / Architectural Status" value="Canonical"/>
                    <property key="v0.2 / Record State" value="current"/>
