                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[CT3] Data Scientist Administration" id="id-fe08dab2f85453af9f1ebec308bf64f6">
                  <documentation>Administer profiles and qualified participation information for data scientists maintaining governed information content.

**Overview**

Administer profiles and qualified participation information for data scientists maintaining governed information content. The reviewed hierarchy assigns this enduring ability to its stated business-enabling context.

**Intent**

Administer profiles and qualified participation information for data scientists maintaining governed information content.

**Boundary**

Information administration and coordination preserve the authority of the responsible source, clinical actor and governed domain; they confer no additional real-world management authority.

## ARB identity continuity

Historical identity [1cb497aec93c4b82ba7f5b622813e54e](1cb497aec93c4b82ba7f5b622813e54e.md) has direct correspondence with this capability under HCRL 1.1.5-002. Historical provenance and UUID reservation remain with that record; this resource retains its existing identity and independent standing.</documentation>
