                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Authorised Research Release Assembly" id="id-91835e68ae02530786223c71a4acaa39" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Assemble and qualify the existing information allowed by a particular authorised research purpose.

**Overview**

The release carries purpose and applicable privacy/consent/use constraints; the requester does not gain unrestricted clinical-record access by having a research role.

**Boundary**

No ethics approval, de-identification guarantee or clinical-trial management is inferred.

