                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Demand &amp; Capacity Planning Projection" id="id-1bd07e714962537590dc80ad2f2c7acd" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Project qualified observed demand, capacity and utilisation for authorised planning consumers.

**Overview**

Comparisons need service, temporal and context qualifiers so that planned future capacity is not confused with present operational capacity.

**Boundary**

Projection does not establish a planning conclusion or allocate services and staff.

