                <folder name="II.1.3.9.13.1.2 [Feature] Information Definition &amp; Schema Governance" id="id-eace778bfbe142ed8136ce952e70f609">
                  <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.9.13.1.2. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=3317bbb7e2db4384abf44a50bf67422c; Exchange identifier=id-087c246587f15ff0b9554654eb508fd2. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Information Definition &amp; Schema Governance" id="id-087c246587f15ff0b9554654eb508fd2" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Govern structural definitions, data dictionaries and constraint meaning.

**Overview**

Existing definition-governance behaviour needs a distinct Feature frame from general semantic-model authorship and runtime validation.

**Boundary**

Governed definitions do not own runtime instances or their clinical facts.</documentation>
