                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[CT3] Enterprise Canonical/Reusable Model Design" id="id-cd6d12693e255af7876c44caddfdbdb4">
                  <documentation>Design canonical and reusable enterprise information models and semantic bindings under applicable information-design governance.

**Overview**

