                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Governance Requirement Version Publication" id="id-012a49f6e1ce5f4094fd4870dfd281d4" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Publish attributable versions and applicability of externally approved governing requirements.

**Overview**

Operational and assurance consumers need to identify the governing basis they used rather than silently substitute a current rule for a historical one.

**Boundary**

Publication does not confer requirement approval, authorisation policy or assurance-criteria authority.</documentation>
