                <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.9.14.1. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=7e780751d50e4ffe942f8443b7cb6567; Exchange identifier=id-43399be21121568aa6b26f5b0c8414c4. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[CT3] Governance Requirement Publication Support" id="id-43399be21121568aa6b26f5b0c8414c4">
                  <documentation>Represent and publish versioned governing requirements for use by authorised operational and assurance consumers.

**Overview**

Consumers need an identifiable statement of which rule applies and who established it. This proposal fills BC-17 information support without giving the platform authority to make legislation, approve governance requirements or reinterpret their force.

**Intent**

Let operational and assurance consumers identify the governing statement and applicability basis they actually used.

**Boundary**

Governance approval remains externally mandated; operational policy, assurance criteria and requirement authority are not interchangeable.</documentation>
