                  <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.9.14.2.1. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=b69936757c4446a7a1b57a455aae7a5f; Exchange identifier=id-a07c25a127ca5917984623d75092c14d. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Mandatory Significant Activity Audit Capture" id="id-a07c25a127ca5917984623d75092c14d" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Capture required significant activity evidence using the specifically governed authoritative audit-capture boundary.

**Overview**

The actor whose action is recorded need not be entitled to persist the audit. Required capture uses its own established authority and failure can block the governed operation.

**Boundary**

Specific audit authority is not borrowed from the audited identity or generalised to other operations.</documentation>
