                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Binary Content Resolution &amp; Assembly" id="id-e3c67fe6821e5511965aa45e07d9d354" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Resolve governed payload associations and retrieve or assemble the content required by a requesting information context.

**Overview**

A logical clinical item may reference externally held or multipart payloads. The Feature supplies a usable content result while retaining custody and missing-content standing.

**Boundary**

No assumption of local copying, shared storage, universal content retention or originating clinical authority.</documentation>
