                <folder name="II.1.3.9.15.2.2 [Feature] Clinical Information Historical Reconstruction" id="id-07c80a3c8c0345d4bba2cd5a4b384347">
                  <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.9.15.2.2. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=838728ef4fd04b4da0c28dc4fce0cfe9; Exchange identifier=id-aac71d2b16d550e4b694338cee216d5a. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Clinical Information Historical Reconstruction" id="id-aac71d2b16d550e4b694338cee216d5a" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Reconstruct what information Harmonia received, knew or managed at a relevant historical basis.

**Overview**

Current state and historical operational truth answer different questions. Reconstruction retains superseded and corrected knowledge without rewriting the earlier record.

**Boundary**

Does not infer that historical information was clinically true or that a present source state applied in the past.</documentation>
