                <folder name="II.1.3.9.15.2.3 [Feature] Durable Clinical Record Preservation" id="id-3c6ed01fccce4936b0fd9fe45a538274">
                  <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.9.15.2.3. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=aba48dbf729d477aa87e112725dc1511; Exchange identifier=id-6116f5faabba5d65b7a1e94486ea164c. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Durable Clinical Record Preservation" id="id-6116f5faabba5d65b7a1e94486ea164c" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Durably maintain governed, vendor-neutral longitudinal clinical representation and preservation with verifiable integrity controls.

Durable preservation retains the governed longitudinal representation and the history of what Harmonia received or managed. Corrections establish changed knowledge without retrospectively rewriting that history, and preservation neither originates clinical facts nor automatically establishes legal qualification of the record.</documentation>
