                <folder name="II.1.3.9.15.2.4 [Feature] Longitudinal Health Record (LHR) Assembly" id="id-a728f40cbdbb4cf6b83f5c5ddf04e876">
                  <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.9.15.2.4. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=c9c1c7a58cb5470db0141329ecc349f4; Exchange identifier=id-1b6407fd4129511ab1134a5156efa49a. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] Longitudinal Health Record (LHR) Assembly" id="id-1b6407fd4129511ab1134a5156efa49a" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Assemble disparate encounters, diagnostic reports, medications, and clinical documents into a unified, vendor-neutral longitudinal timeline.

Longitudinal assembly relates contributions from disparate systems into a usable chronology. The unified view preserves source and subject context rather than turning consolidation into originating clinical authority or erasing differences in the standing of individual assertions.</documentation>
