                  <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: II.1.3.9.15.3.1. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=869b77462ece488788c5a20598e7d587; Exchange identifier=id-27699af98b8b57449168f0731d027a57. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
                  <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[Feature] General Practice Shared Record Ingestion" id="id-27699af98b8b57449168f0731d027a57" profiles="id-1fcc283b6cc74eab958ce9580eacd631">
                    <documentation>Ingest shared health summaries, encounter notes, and immunization records from primary care practice management systems.

Shared-record ingestion brings general-practice contributions into cross-provider continuity. The summary or encounter note retains its clinical source while becoming available alongside regional information; consolidation does not transfer the GP's professional authority to the platform.</documentation>
