## ARB identity continuity

Historical identity [2e4de521bda24ad7b0ea64ae535b7f84](2e4de521bda24ad7b0ea64ae535b7f84.md) has direct correspondence with this capability under HCRL 1.1.5-002. Historical provenance and UUID reservation remain with that record; this resource retains its existing identity and independent standing.

## ARB source correspondence

Scope/anti-responsibility and clinical/operational meaning establish the responsible Capability; descriptive ledger/registry/asset labels do not establish a separately bounded formal Information Concept. Preserve non-transfer and source authority.

Source: `docs/markdown/03-business-architecture/information-responsibility/information-responsibility.md` — information responsibility row 21. Standing: Established Business responsibility only; formal information identity/lifecycle not inferred.

```text
| **Patient Clinical Record** | **Governed Longitudinal Health Record (LHR)** | Governed longitudinal synthesis, chronological clinical timeline, active problem/allergy information and immutable history of what Harmonia received, knew or managed. Correction/supersession does not retrospectively alter that historical record. | Does not own original legal documents or acquire originating clinical authority; current authoritative state remains distinct from historical operational truth. |
```</documentation>
