## ARB identity continuity

Historical identity [c89e7c8b277247d9965fdb534aad2d1f](c89e7c8b277247d9965fdb534aad2d1f.md) has direct correspondence with this capability under HCRL 1.1.5-002. Historical provenance and UUID reservation remain with that record; this resource retains its existing identity and independent standing.

## ARB source correspondence

Scope/anti-responsibility and clinical/operational meaning establish the responsible Capability; descriptive ledger/registry/asset labels do not establish a separately bounded formal Information Concept. Preserve non-transfer and source authority.

Source: `docs/markdown/03-business-architecture/information-responsibility/information-responsibility.md` — information responsibility row 36. Standing: Established Business responsibility only; formal information identity/lifecycle not inferred.

```text
| **Presentation Services** | **Presentation Specification &amp; Layout Preferences** | Responsive presentation structures, presentation layouts, and clinician preference configurations. | Does not own presented clinical or operational data. |
```</documentation>
