              <documentation>Enable governed shared health-information use, exchange, stewardship, knowledge, collaboration, external work coordination, calendars, presentation and information design.

**Overview**

Enable governed shared health-information use, exchange, stewardship, knowledge, collaboration, external work coordination, calendars, presentation and information design.

**Intent**

Enable governed shared health-information use, exchange, stewardship, knowledge, collaboration, external work coordination, calendars, presentation and information design.

**Boundary**

Preservation, custody, discoverability and presentation do not confer originating fact authority. Clinical documentation administration and clinical-context use retain their own responsibilities.

## ARB identity continuity

Historical identity [eeabb9c3c526404cbe4302906560fa7e](eeabb9c3c526404cbe4302906560fa7e.md) has direct correspondence with this capability under HCRL 1.1.5-002. Historical provenance and UUID reservation remain with that record; this resource retains its existing identity and independent standing.</documentation>
