        <element xsi:type="archimate:Capability" name="[CT1] Care Access &amp; Coordination" id="id-f78a7520ea80532b8423fc652b12ff6a">
          <documentation>The governed source has no established definition. This absence is retained for Solution Architect review; no definition is inferred from the name.

## ARB correspondence

Same bounded capability at the same tier, BC/BEC context and complete recorded canonical hierarchy; current responsibility/provenance supplies the represented meaning. No contrary historical definition is present. Correspondence is adjudicated under the ARB semantic-continuity rule, not inferred by the application adapter.

Current representation: [[CT1] Care Access &amp; Coordination](ed342cb8656b4f80b55ad519ecbd2d3a.md). This resource reserves the historical identity and representation for provenance and existing Views. Its missing original definition remains missing.</documentation>
