          <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessCollaboration" name="Care-Team Collaboration" id="id-616a1d7bc3385a4a804d96f3fb22dc06">
            <documentation>- **Purpose**: Governs the active, multidisciplinary clinical team assembled around a specific patient for an acute episode, chronic disease management programme, or inpatient stay.
- **Participating Roles**: `Clinician` (Lead &amp; Consulting), `Care Coordinator`, `Patient`, `Carer`, `Performer`.
- **Governed Activities**: Shared care planning, real-time longitudinal health record (LHR) review, multidisciplinary ward rounds, clinical messaging, and transition-of-care handovers.</documentation>
