            <documentation>- **Purpose**: Governs facility-wide operational logistics, resource balancing, bed management, patient flow coordination, and dispatch between clinical units and non-clinical support services.
- **Participating Roles**: `Patient Flow Coordinator`, `Bed Manager`, `Ward Coordinator`, `Work Coordinator`, `Wardsperson`.
- **Governed Activities**: Daily operational huddles, emergency department bed pull, ward turnover coordination, porter dispatch, and discharge transport scheduling.</documentation>
