            <documentation>- **Purpose**: Governs professional peer-to-peer clinical engagement, informal secondary consultations, multidisciplinary review panels, and clinical knowledge sharing across practitioner networks.
- **Participating Roles**: `Practitioner`, `Clinician`, `Care Coordinator`, `Terminology Steward`.
- **Governed Activities**: Peer review, diagnostic consultation, case conferencing, and shared clinical governance discussions.</documentation>
