              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessFunction" name="Assemble Purpose-Qualified Research Release" id="id-8c21d9dcc7a15e44bad797ce63244403">
                <documentation>Construct a release containing only existing information permitted for the explicitly authorised research purpose.

**Overview**

Moves a qualified request to a bounded release with source attribution and applicable use constraints.

**Boundary**

Does not author ethics approvals, promise de-identification or acquire ownership of research conclusions.</documentation>
