nt Operations, Outpatient Operations and Mobile Staff Management. Their local information responsibilities express available, committed and utilised capacity without prescribing a shared formal Information Object or identical model. Bed/care-place and equipment state contribute; they do not alone establish service capacity. Service Capacity Management consumes/coordinates those capacity states; Work Allocation &amp; Dispatch and Discharge Management may consume them without acquiring their ownership. Exact provider contracts remain unestablished.&quot;}],&quot;method&quot;:&quot;AI architectural synthesis under the explicitly authorised Step 2 task&quot;},&quot;record_state&quot;:&quot;pending_adjudication&quot;,&quot;reference_id&quot;:&quot;HCM-SV-service-offering-readiness-query&quot;,&quot;sources&quot;:[],&quot;structural_id_status&quot;:&quot;Proposed&quot;,&quot;tier&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;service&quot;,&quot;unresolved&quot;:[],&quot;views&quot;:[]}"/>
