                <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessFunction" name="Assess Service Offering Readiness" id="id-839281bb947054459ba35072f71c6885">
                  <documentation>Evaluate applicable dependency evidence to establish a context- and time-qualified service readiness view.

**Overview**

Combines qualified dependency standing without converting missing evidence into ready or assuming that an available resource establishes deliverability.

**Boundary**

Resource ownership and clinical clearance remain external to this coordination.</documentation>
