## Source-qualified contribution

Source: `docs/markdown/03-business-architecture/behaviours/04-health-service-operations.md` — entry lines 205-205. Standing: exact originating assertion; current resource standing unchanged.

- *Terminology*: External “work/task” vocabulary does not make human work a Harmonia Task. Work Order means human doing; To Do means human review/update/approval; Task means synthetic task. The preferred Strategy name `Mobile Work Task Management Integration` remains a proposed naming correction pending human confirmation, not a new Feature or alias.</documentation>
