              <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessFunction" name="Manage Outpatient Capacity" id="id-b3c65c2c554f57d39709388e51350155">
                <documentation>Understands and manages available, committed and utilised outpatient capacity through clinic/session, practitioner and room availability, appointment demand, patient arrival/waiting and operational progression. Retains specialty room allocation and clinician arrival tracking.

