                  <documentation>Allow authorised domain coordinators to submit an entity-relative stimulus or requested operational effect.

**Overview**

Acceptance concerns the stated handoff contract; the caller observes completion/effect through separately qualified progression information.

**Boundary**

Input acceptance does not establish successful completion or authority over source clinical facts.

## Qualified relationship assertions

Original source predicates, evidence and qualifications remain in the metadata. The ARB has now adjudicated their native treatment; explicitly unestablished relationship existence remains excluded. Native representation does not promote source standing.

