                <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessFunction" name="Maintain Operational Fulfilment Definition" id="id-1731c2477c425e4a8bc04a3247814e25">
                  <documentation>Establish and revise the declared context needs, expected outcome basis and housekeeping of an operational undertaking.

**Overview**

Changes governed activity design while preserving the applicability of the definition used by an existing undertaking.

**Boundary**

A definition revision is not a command to run work or a dynamic clinical workflow generator.</documentation>
