nonical&quot;, &quot;placement_status&quot;: &quot;Proposed&quot;, &quot;semantic&quot;: &quot;Canonical&quot;, &quot;structural_id_status&quot;: &quot;Proposed&quot;}, &quot;title&quot;: &quot;[CT3] Workflow &amp; Activity Coordination&quot;}, &quot;contextRole&quot;: &quot;capability&quot;, &quot;number&quot;: &quot;III.4.5.1.3&quot;}], &quot;occurrence&quot;: &quot;architectural&quot;, &quot;references&quot;: []}"/>
