                  <property key="v0.2 / Snapshot Record JSON" value="{&quot;adjudication_note&quot;:&quot;HUMAN ADJUDICATION REQUIRED: Canonical assurance against a governed subject is not independent review of the assurance service itself.&quot;,&quot;ancestry_status&quot;:&quot;proposed&quot;,&quot;architectural_status&quot;:&quot;Canonical&quot;,&quot;baseline_description&quot;:{&quot;Service Overview&quot;:&quot;The status Service exposes progression of an identifiable assurance activity exclusively to System Steward. Its client question is where the activity has reached, not what the evidence will establish. Requesting assurance does not automatically grant status access, and progression observation is stewardship rather than recursive assurance.&quot;},&quot;baseline_placement&quot;:{&quot;canonical_id&quot;:null,&quot;owner_key&quot;:&quot;capability:governed-assurance&quot;,&quot;parent_key&quot;:null,&quot;tier&quot;:null},&quot;baseline_unresolved&quot;:[&quot;ancestry&quot;,&quot;canonical_id&quot;,&quot;code_allocation&quot;,&quot;feature_association&quot;,&quot;contextual_view&quot;,&quot;function_mapping&quot;],&quot;baseline_version&quot;:&quot;0.1&quot;,&quot;canonical_id&quot;:&quot;CT1-BEC-INDEPENDENT-SERVICE-ASSURANCE-ENABLEMENT.CT2-BEC-INDEPENDENT-ASSURANCE-EVALUATION-ENABLEMENT.CT3-BEC-GOVERNED-ASSURANCE.SV-REQUEST-SERVICE-ASSURANCE-STATUS&quot;,&quot;canonical_name&quot;:&quot;Request Service Assurance Status&quot;,&quot;category&quot;:null,&quot;governed_definition_latex&quot;:&quot;\n\\begin{itemize}\n\n\\item \n\\textbf{Canonical Name}: \\texttt{\\seqsplit{Request Service Assurance Status}}.\n\n\n\n\\item \n\\textbf{Definition}: Enables the System Steward to obtain the current business progression state of an identifiable Service Assurance activity for stewardship purposes.\n\n\n\n\\item \n\\textbf{Only Approved Consumer}: \\texttt{\\seqsplit{System Steward}}.\n\n\n\n\\item \n\\textbf{Associated Interaction}: \\href{https://github.com/fhirfactory/harmonia/blob/98410db60155198a75f74c79d98060070209faa1/docs/markdown/03-business-architecture/collaborations-interactions/interactions.md\\#service-assurance-status}{Service Assurance Status}, between System Steward and Service Guardian.\n\n\n\n\\item \n\\textbf{Status Boundary}: Concerns \\textbf{activity progression state}. It does not communicate provisional findings, incomplete assessment results as conclusions, predicted outcomes or unadjudicated conclusions. Other requesting Roles do not gain status access merely because they requested assurance. No detailed activity-status taxonomy is established.\n\n\n\n\\end{itemize}\n\n\\textbf{Service Assurance Status answers \&quot;where is the assurance activity in its progression?\&quot; It does not answer \&quot;what has the assurance established?\&quot;} The latter requires an adjudicated Assurance Finding /\\allowbreak{} Conclusion and subsequent outcome communication; neither status nor execution completion establishes that conclusion.\n\n\n\\textbf{Management Monitoring evaluates activity state in order to progress or manage activity. Assurance evaluates activity against governing criteria in order to establish an assurance conclusion.} System Steward's use of this Service is stewardship /\\allowbreak{} management observation of assurance progression, not itself assurance or recursive assurance. The non-recursion boundary in §7.2 applies.\n\n\n\n\n&quot;,&quot;id_aliases&quot;:[],&quot;key&quot;:&quot;service:request-service-assurance-status&quot;,&quot;latex_label&quot;:&quot;service:request-service-assurance-status&quot;,&quot;local_id&quot;:&quot;REQUEST-SERVICE-ASSURANCE-STATUS&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Request Service Assurance Status&quot;,&quot;name_aliases&quot;:[],&quot;name_status&quot;:&quot;Canonical&quot;,&quot;owner_identifier&quot;:&quot;HCM-BEC-governed-assurance&quot;,&quot;owner_key&quot;:&quot;capability:governed-assurance&quot;,&quot;parent_identifier&quot;:null,&quot;parent_key&quot;:null,&quot;placement_status&quot;:&quot;Established&quot;,&quot;pre_review_record&quot;:{&quot;ancestry_status&quot;:&quot;proposed&quot;,&quot;architectural_status&quot;:&quot;Canonical&quot;,&quot;baseline_description&quot;:{&quot;Service Overview&quot;:&quot;The status Service exposes progression of an identifiable assurance activity exclusively to System Steward. Its client question is where the activity has reached, not what the evidence will establish. Requesting assurance does not automatically grant status access, and progression observation is stewardship rather than recursive assurance.&quot;},&quot;baseline_placement&quot;:{&quot;canonical_id&quot;:null,&quot;owner_key&quot;:&quot;capability:governed-assurance&quot;,&quot;parent_key&quot;:null,&quot;tier&quot;:null},&quot;baseline_unresolved&quot;:[&quot;ancestry&quot;,&quot;canonical_id&quot;,&quot;code_allocation&quot;,&quot;feature_association&quot;,&quot;contextual_view&quot;,&quot;function_mapping&quot;],&quot;baseline_version&quot;:&quot;0.1&quot;,&quot;canonical_id&quot;:&quot;CT1-BEC-INDEPENDENT-SERVICE-ASSURANCE-ENABLEMENT.CT2-BEC-INDEPENDENT-ASSURANCE-EVALUATION-ENABLEMENT.CT3-BEC-GOVERNED-ASSURANCE.SV-REQUEST-SERVICE-ASSURANCE-STATUS&quot;,&quot;canonical_name&quot;:&quot;Request Service Assurance Status&quot;,&quot;category&quot;:null,&quot;governed_definition_latex&quot;:&quot;\n\\begin{itemize}\n\n\\item \n\\textbf{Canonical Name}: \\texttt{\\seqsplit{Request Service Assurance Status}}.\n\n\n\n\\item \n\\textbf{Definition}: Enables the System Steward to obtain the current business progression state of an identifiable Service Assurance activity for stewardship purposes.\n\n\n\n\\item \n\\textbf{Only Approved Consumer}: \\texttt{\\seqsplit{System Steward}}.\n\n\n\n\\item \n\\textbf{Associated Interaction}: \\href{https://github.com/fhirfactory/harmonia/blob/98410db60155198a75f74c79d98060070209faa1/docs/markdown/03-business-architecture/collaborations-interactions/interactions.md\\#service-assurance-status}{Service Assurance Status}, between System Steward and Service Guardian.\n\n\n\n\\item \n\\textbf{Status Boundary}: Concerns \\textbf{activity progression state}. It does not communicate provisional findings, incomplete assessment results as conclusions, predicted outcomes or unadjudicated conclusions. Other requesting Roles do not gain status access merely because they requested assurance. No detailed activity-status taxonomy is established.\n\n\n\n\\end{itemize}\n\n\\textbf{Service Assurance Status answers \&quot;where is the assurance activity in its progression?\&quot; It does not answer \&quot;what has the assurance established?\&quot;} The latter requires an adjudicated Assurance Finding /\\allowbreak{} Conclusion and subsequent outcome communication; neither status nor execution completion establishes that conclusion.\n\n\n\\textbf{Management Monitoring evaluates activity state in order to progress or manage activity. Assurance evaluates activity against governing criteria in order to establish an assurance conclusion.} System Steward's use of this Service is stewardship /\\allowbreak{} management observation of assurance progression, not itself assurance or recursive assurance. The non-recursion boundary in §7.2 applies.\n\n\n\n\n&quot;,&quot;id_aliases&quot;:[],&quot;key&quot;:&quot;service:request-service-assurance-status&quot;,&quot;latex_label&quot;:&quot;service:request-service-assurance-status&quot;,&quot;local_id&quot;:&quot;REQUEST-SERVICE-ASSURANCE-STATUS&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Request Service Assurance Status&quot;,&quot;name_aliases&quot;:[],&quot;name_status&quot;:&quot;Canonical&quot;,&quot;owner_identifier&quot;:&quot;HCM-BEC-governed-assurance&quot;,&quot;owner_key&quot;:&quot;capability:governed-assurance&quot;,&quot;parent_identifier&quot;:null,&quot;parent_key&quot;:null,&quot;placement_status&quot;:&quot;Established&quot;,&quot;reference_id&quot;:&quot;HCM-SV-request-service-assurance-status&quot;,&quot;responsibility_ow