                <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessFunction" name="Accept Governed Dataset Revision" id="id-9b80dfad3498500983d9e0a9c0de1617">
                  <documentation>Apply an explicitly authorised content revision and its effective standing through governed information-state progression.

**Overview**

Moves a reviewed change to the applicable approved content revision, retaining attribution and uncertainty if durable establishment cannot be confirmed.

**Boundary**

The Function does not invent who approves or become a persistence manager.</documentation>
