                <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessService" name="Associated Binary Content Retrieval" id="id-4a95ba1792425d52b3efcface99d5162">
                  <documentation>Allow information-consuming capabilities to request resolution and retrieval of associated content.

**Overview**

The client contract returns authorised content or explicit incomplete/unavailable standing while retaining custody attribution.

**Boundary**

The client acquires neither physical repository access nor originating clinical authority.

## Qualified relationship assertions

Original source predicates, evidence and qualifications remain in the metadata. The ARB has now adjudicated their native treatment; explicitly unestablished relationship existence remains excluded. Native representation does not promote source standing.

| Source predicate | Target element | Source standing / currentness | ARB native treatment |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| uses_function | [Resolve Associated Binary Content](../business-function/118867dc136f4f689265b173abdf626b.md) | Proposed / current | Serving (reverse) — `id-2b86bbee955357de96fb8823985aee33` |
| uses_function | [Assemble Associated Binary Content](../business-function/0a0a5f3e40d241e38a5b155ca66eadd5.md) | Proposed / current | Serving (reverse) — `id-4066e2c284e85b10899afcb57b8369ec` |</documentation>
