                <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessFunction" name="Assemble Associated Binary Content" id="id-6e0542071ced53d89091019e51e6a8e7">
                  <documentation>Retrieve and assemble the requested logical content from its permitted constituent payloads.

**Overview**

Moves a qualified retrieval request to an assembled result or explicit unavailable/partial standing.

**Boundary**

No storage topology or universal local custody is selected.</documentation>
