                <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessFunction" name="Preserve Durable Clinical Record" id="id-1265240e650f5d3d969f58bba75a7a2f">
                  <documentation>Preserves the governed longitudinal representation and durable, immutable, append-only history of what Harmonia received, knew, asserted or managed, with provenance and versioning. Corrections/supersession establish changed knowledge without retrospectively altering that history or acquiring originating clinical authority.

