            <folder name="IV.1.1.3.5 [Topic] OrganisationIdentity" id="id-905ab1b34ed1488ba613f2e5f98cab4e">
              <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: IV.1.1.3.5. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=c240be16de76415682237a238b3d3fc8; Exchange identifier=id-760c399c8f624e1cb3dcdda8ebaef492. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:DataObject" name="[Topic] OrganisationIdentity" id="id-760c399c8f624e1cb3dcdda8ebaef492" profiles="id-a8def6185ec847d6a729560440adb050">
                <documentation>**Description**
Information used to identify, distinguish and correlate an organisation across authorities, systems and healthcare contexts.

- **Semantic Classification**: `Assertion / Identity Bundle`
- **Definition**: The governed set of official enterprise identifiers, registry bindings, and external directory identifiers establishing the identity of the organisation.
- **Key Semantic Decomposition**:
  - `Identifier Value`: The token or registration number identifying the organisation.
  - `Identifier Authority / Namespace`: The statutory authority, national healthcare directory, or enterprise namespace issuing the identifier.

Source standing: Established Package1 conceptual information meaning; residual qualifications in selected section remain unchanged.</documentation>
