            <folder name="IV.1.1.5.4 [Topic] Identity" id="id-a3c8206035e94e55a0e172a80299c804">
              <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: IV.1.1.5.4. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=3b72456b5686449f95ad26bfbbae07f3; Exchange identifier=id-e6876f4592f94aa28019ccccd493d31c. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
