            <folder name="IV.1.1.5.6 [Topic] Person" id="id-fb3546444ed54b9797218f3b23df2068">
              <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: IV.1.1.5.6. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=1163ffac87814f319578ef5cb95dcd4d; Exchange identifier=id-55ba50d6357443f8ba4b1f7dabca86af. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:DataObject" name="[Topic] Person" id="id-55ba50d6357443f8ba4b1f7dabca86af" profiles="id-a8def6185ec847d6a729560440adb050">
                <documentation>**Definition**: The identifiable biological and legal human entity.

**Description**: Information describing an individual as an enduring human entity, independent of any particular healthcare interaction, role or episode of care.

**Semantic Classification**: `Entity`

**Architectural Scope**: Represents the enduring human being independently of any specific clinical encounter, healthcare facility, or operational role. A `Person` exists prior to and outside of any interaction with the healthcare system.

Source standing: Established Package1 conceptual information meaning; residual qualifications in selected section remain unchanged.</documentation>
