          <folder name="IV.1.1.9 [Topic] Service" id="id-8ab3a37c8fbf4eb3b5895109ef930f0a">
            <folder name="IV.1.1.9.1 [Topic] ServiceAssurance" id="id-834d0a4d2ec5475f8c4138a96c5ae51a">
              <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: IV.1.1.9.1. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=07a1f83c9b4e462eaef1595c2a50d560; Exchange identifier=id-226e5dddcac040d99e482ac142e8888a. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:DataObject" name="[Topic] ServiceAssurance" id="id-226e5dddcac040d99e482ac142e8888a" profiles="id-a8def6185ec847d6a729560440adb050">
                <documentation>**Description**
Information describing the assurance context associated with a healthcare service, including the evidence or determination that its provision satisfies applicable expectations, requirements or obligations.

- **Semantic Classification**: `Accountability / Audit Record`
- **Definition**: The formal retrospective quality evaluation, clinical audit, accreditation review, or funding/billing reconciliation assessed against delivered services and outcomes.
- **Architectural Scope &amp; Ownership Assessment**: Evaluates single service deliveries or aggregated cohorts across an episode of care. Because Harmonia's core operational capabilities do not claim R1 architectural ownership for statutory health insurance billing reconciliation or external accreditation governance, `AssuredHealthcareService` is designated as a **Reference / Contextual Concept** where Harmonia consumes or supports assurance interfaces without owning the external statutory authority.

Source standing: Established Package1 conceptual information meaning; residual qualifications in selected section remain unchanged.</documentation>
                <property key="Baseline / Source Path" value="docs/markdown/04-information-architecture/information-families/healthcare-service.md"/>
                <property key="Baseline / Source Section" value="### Stage 5: AssuredHealthcareService (Accountability)"/>
