            </folder>
            <folder name="IV.1.1.9.2 [Topic] ServiceDelivery" id="id-8a8eff082f2e4a28b194d598789f5189">
              <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: IV.1.1.9.2. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=4627ee33845744f2ae2e10c84e313755; Exchange identifier=id-2a4ae1ab99ca4483b2380e5da7cfb26e. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:DataObject" name="[Topic] ServiceDelivery" id="id-2a4ae1ab99ca4483b2380e5da7cfb26e" profiles="id-a8def6185ec847d6a729560440adb050">
                <documentation>**Description**
Information describing the actual provision of a healthcare service within a particular subject, provider, place and delivery context.

- **Semantic Classification**: `Activity / Fulfilment`
- **Definition**: An Information Concept referring to the real-world execution or performance of a healthcare service for a specific target subject (or facility target) at a concrete point in time. It represents information about the activity rather than becoming the activity or implying that Harmonia performs it.
- **Key Characteristics**: Actual start/end timestamps, performing practitioners, delivery location, executing devices/equipment, and execution status progression.
- **Healthcare Subject Invariant**: While clinical service deliveries typically associate with a `Healthcare Subject Context`, broader service semantics (e.g., *Facility Sanitisation*, *Water Quality Testing*, *Equipment Calibration*) do not universally require a Healthcare Subject.

Source standing: Established Package1 conceptual information meaning; residual qualifications in selected section remain unchanged.</documentation>
                <property key="Baseline / Source Path" value="docs/markdown/04-information-architecture/information-families/healthcare-service.md"/>
                <property key="Baseline / Source Section" value="### Stage 3: HealthcareServiceDelivery (Fulfilment)"/>
