            <folder name="IV.1.1.9.5 [Topic] ServiceProvision" id="id-1c4aea438d144e069489e4f89c820094">
              <documentation>Continuum navigation coordinate: IV.1.1.9.5. Navigation asserts no semantic containment. Occurrence: architectural; no additional architectural instance or semantic relationship. Canonical element directory: canonicalId=8d41e9fb6a164deb93afb5fc4c671e10; Exchange identifier=id-45c96a7f74a5439abe63dbf78e35c9e0. Existing governed hierarchy member; directory retained for leaves.</documentation>
              <element xsi:type="archimate:DataObject" name="[Topic] ServiceProvision" id="id-45c96a7f74a5439abe63dbf78e35c9e0" profiles="id-a8def6185ec847d6a729560440adb050">
                <documentation>**Description**
Information describing an offered service contextualised for actual provision, including the provider, location, applicable conditions and other bindings necessary for the service to be delivered.

- **Semantic Classification**: `Contextual Binding`
- **Definition**: The contextual binding of an `OfferedHealthcareService` to a specific providing organisation, delivery location, participating practitioner roles, operational availability schedules, and eligibility rule sets.
- **Key Characteristics**: Bound service definition, performing organisation, delivery site, participating practitioner role bindings, intake schedule, and catchment criteria.

Source standing: Established Package1 conceptual information meaning; residual qualifications in selected section remain unchanged.</documentation>
