              <documentation>- **Role:** candidate logical application embodiment associated with the
  ActionableTaskArchetype meta-concept, within Mneme Pragma Management C28.
  [U01/U02](../../../../docs/markdown/05-information-systems-architecture/sources.md#u02). The meta-concept is not itself an instantiated
