        <element xsi:type="archimate:Requirement" name="AI Assurance Architecture Discovery Before Implementation" id="id-154c9b8f5201556699719d97dba4199d">
          <documentation>Domain05 must undertake explicit Information Systems Layer Architecture discovery before implementation models are finalised, including: AI model/service selection and abstraction; context/input construction; information disclosure/security; model/service provenance and versioning; confidence/uncertainty/result representation; deterministic versus non-deterministic behaviour; reproducibility; result validation; human review/escalation; assurance evidence representation; workflow integration; failure/timeout/unavailability behaviour; and reporting/observability consistent with Dokimasia's terminal-boundary rules.

This assertion is normalised from the governed DesignNote under U02/U06/U19 and the ARB release Praxis. Original candidate/release qualifications and separately deferred implementation details remain in force.

Architectural subject: [Energeia](../../application/application-component/fb3f37a6ac614415ac486a6de9d35994.md).</documentation>
