        <element xsi:type="archimate:Requirement" name="PROV-001 — End-to-End Provenance" id="id-3d2ca61c5d7a561e897f95a3b1278d41">
          <documentation>Harmonia shall retain sufficient provenance to determine the origin, actors, transformations, processing history, and resulting artefacts associated with clinically or operationally material information.

## ARB source correspondence

Same end-to-end attributable origin, actors, transformations, processing and outcomes concern; accountable is contextual qualification, not a distinct requirement.

Source: `docs/markdown/01-motivation/requirements-constraints/master-requirements-catalogue.md` — catalogue row PROV-001. Standing: Candidate catalogue assertion; historical resource standing unchanged.

