        <element xsi:type="archimate:Principle" name="Canonical Modeling with Standardized FHIR R5 Boundaries" id="id-269883f59f715a80849b111323ee6f57">
          <documentation>Internal workflow state is represented using the canonical Pragma domain model in Calliope. All external boundary interactions and REST APIs adhere strictly to HL7 FHIR R5 resource definitions.</documentation>
