\part{Business Capability Architecture}\label{model:bc}
The established 190-node BC hierarchy is retained. Six Proposed CT3 refinements and one Proposed preparedness CT2 are additive. The three existing Candidate concerns retain Candidate status and receive Proposed placement. Clinical and enterprise authority remain separate from Harmonia information support.

