\cataloguefield{subsubsection}{Capability Overview}

Determine the intended clinical response and its sequencing in relation to agreed care goals. The proposed decomposition separates this outcome from the other responsibilities within Individual Care Planning.


\cataloguefield{subsubsection}{Definition — Proposed}

Determine the intended clinical response and its sequencing in relation to agreed care goals.


\cataloguefield{subsubsection}{Intent}

Make the intended clinical response coherent in relation to the agreed care goals.


\cataloguefield{subsubsection}{Boundary}

Planning is distinct from intervention delivery and from the operational definition of a synthetic activity.


\cataloguefield{subsubsection}{Review Confidence}
Medium; applies to the proposal, not to preserved canonical meaning.
\cataloguefield{subsubsection}{Derivation Provenance}
Inferred from bounded responsibilities and their semantic decomposition. AI architectural synthesis under the explicitly authorised Step 2 task \hyperref[evidence:a4c0900c47c945d9]{business-capabilities.md:312}
