\cataloguefield{subsubsection}{Capability Overview}

Prepare or compound a clinically required medication formulation under the applicable professional and product-governance mandate. The proposed decomposition separates this outcome from the other responsibilities within Medication \&amp; Pharmacy Services.


\cataloguefield{subsubsection}{Definition — Proposed}

Prepare or compound a clinically required medication formulation under the applicable professional and product-governance mandate.


\cataloguefield{subsubsection}{Intent}

Provide the required medication formulation when ordinary supply alone does not satisfy the authorised preparation need.


\cataloguefield{subsubsection}{Boundary}

Preparation differs from dispensing and administration; this proposal assigns no compounding activity to Harmonia.


\cataloguefield{subsubsection}{Review Confidence}
Medium; applies to the proposal, not to preserved canonical meaning.
