\cataloguefield{subsection}{Capability Overview}

Financial \&amp; Commercial Services provides the financial business frame needed for the bounded R1/\allowbreak{}R2 responsibility. Its established child identifies and supplies information about chargeable or cost-relevant clinical activity. The purpose is to make applicable activity evidence available to the responsible financial context without expanding the model into pricing, claims or revenue management.


\cataloguefield{subsection}{Definition / governed semantic detail}

Provide the financial/\allowbreak{}commercial business context materially required for R1/\allowbreak{}R2.


\cataloguefield{subsection}{Intent}

Support legitimate funding, financial and charging purposes with relevant clinical-activity information.


\cataloguefield{subsection}{Boundary — v0.1 explanation}

Not every exchanged request or activity is chargeable. Provision of evidence does not establish a charging decision or an enterprise financial system.


\cataloguefield{subsection}{Scope / Contained Elements}
