\part{Business Enabling Capability Architecture}\label{model:bec}
The seven CT1 branches follow the human-reviewed candidate hierarchy. Compatible existing responsibilities and meaningful Feature frames are retained or relocated; structural relationships remain Proposed. Explicit Not Addressed in R1.x / R2.x annotations are scope statements, independent of architectural status. Superseded records and unresolved semantic conflicts are preserved in a separate register, outside this current hierarchy.

