\textbf{Previous definition:} Specifying medical equipment types, models, and regulatory classifications.


\textbf{Previous overview:} A device type has a model, regulatory description and stated capabilities used to interpret equipment context. This type-level responsibility differs from identifying the actual physical instance that produced information.


