\cataloguefield{paragraph}{Feature Overview}

The finalised-report Feature remains unchanged. The broader documented diagnostic behaviour needs a separate frame for information whose preliminary or correction standing is material.


\cataloguefield{paragraph}{Definition — Proposed}

Receive, qualify and distribute preliminary, corrected and addendum diagnostic information with its relationship to prior reports.


\cataloguefield{paragraph}{Boundary}

Does not originate diagnostic interpretation or silently overwrite a previously received report.


\cataloguefield{paragraph}{Proposed Placement Rationale}

Meaningful reviewed CT3 framing selected for the existing Feature semantics; established responsibility provenance is preserved.


\cataloguefield{paragraph}{Derivation Provenance}
Inferred from capability-specific behaviour, v0.3 inspection and current architectural evidence. AI architectural synthesis under the explicitly authorised Step 2 task \hyperref[evidence:be61392fefb4bb10]{information-responsibility.md:10}; \hyperref[evidence:6406afcee0abd109]{02-service-administration.md:109}
