\cataloguefield{paragraph}{Feature Overview}

Acknowledgement tracking associates delivery and read evidence with the communication transaction. Each receipt retains its contractual meaning; neither delivery nor reading alone proves business acceptance, clinical review, approval, finality or originating authority.


\cataloguefield{paragraph}{Definition / governed semantic detail}

Correlate recipient delivery and read receipts with outbound clinical communications, distinguishing transport delivery from recipient acknowledgement. Receipt/\allowbreak{}read evidence does not by itself establish business acceptance, clinical review, incorporation, approval, finality or originating authority.


\cataloguefield{paragraph}{Proposed Placement Rationale}

Meaningful reviewed CT3 framing selected for the existing Feature semantics; established responsibility provenance is preserved.


