\cataloguefield{subsection}{Capability Overview}

Establish and curate governed data assets suitable for explicitly authorised research use, retaining source attribution and applicable release constraints.


\cataloguefield{subsection}{Definition — Reviewed candidate}

Establish and curate governed data assets suitable for explicitly authorised research use, retaining source attribution and applicable release constraints.


\cataloguefield{subsection}{Boundary}

Does not grant ethics approval, recruit trial participants, manage trials or become the authority for derived research conclusions.


\cataloguefield{subsection}{Proposed Placement Rationale}

Responsibility-preserving placement under the human-reviewed BEC hierarchy; the structural assertion remains Proposed.


\cataloguefield{subsection}{Review Confidence}
Medium; applies to the proposal, not to preserved canonical meaning.
\cataloguefield{subsection}{Derivation Provenance}
Inferred from bounded responsibilities and their semantic decomposition. AI architectural synthesis under the explicitly authorised Step 2 task \hyperref[evidence:a4c0900c47c945d9]{business-capabilities.md:842}; \hyperref[evidence:be61392fefb4bb10]{information-responsibility.md:10}
