\textbf{Previous definition:} Prepare, convey and track required population-health notifications from applicable governed source information.


\textbf{Previous overview:} A reportable event and the obligation to notify are different from sending a message. This capability preserves the established obligation and observes the notification outcome under its contract without deciding public-health response.


\textbf{Previous intent:} Keep the applicable notification duty and the observed communication disposition traceable to each other.


