\textbf{Previous definition:} Supply qualified demand, utilisation and capacity evidence to responsible health-service planning activities.


\textbf{Previous overview:} Planners need comparable time- and service-qualified observations from multiple operating settings. This ability prepares those projections while leaving the interpretation of required future capacity and distribution with the planning authority.


\textbf{Previous intent:} Give planners qualified observed evidence without predetermining the planning judgement.


