\part{Enterprise Capability Architecture}\label{model:ec}
EC-01 through EC-14 retain Canonical responsibility, stable Reference ID and exact governed scope. Three Proposed CT1s and selected CT3 specialisations form one integrated hierarchy. Historical EC tokens are direct structural-ID aliases. No Feature is placed under an EC, and no application-component or deployment allocation is inferred.

