\cataloguefield{subsubsection}{Capability Overview}

Active representation, observation and convergence support availability while preserving an explicit trust basis for use.


\cataloguefield{subsubsection}{Definition — Proposed}

Maintain responsive, reconstructable active information and coordinate its safe use.


\cataloguefield{subsubsection}{Intent}

Provide responsive managed use without promoting active representation into durable truth.


\cataloguefield{subsubsection}{Boundary}

An active generation is not an authoritative version; failure to converge does not establish valid active state.


\cataloguefield{subsubsection}{Derivation Provenance}
Inferred from bounded responsibilities and their semantic decomposition. AI architectural synthesis under the explicitly authorised Step 2 task \hyperref[evidence:27549d51551beae6]{architectural-axioms.md:247}; \hyperref[evidence:ea0c62dfd5edfd4a]{context-and-persistence-management.md:52}
