Preserved context references &amp; \nameref{cap:bec-independent-service-assurance-enablement} $\rightarrow$ \nameref{cap:bec-independent-assurance-evaluation-enablement} &amp; Linked responsibility references; historical records do not assert current ancestry.\\\hline
