Maintain distinguishable care-episode, bounded fulfilment and delivered-activity information across performing systems. Its constituent abilities distinguish Episode \&amp; Encounter Administration; Order Administration; Diagnostic Administration; Medication Administration; Procedure Administration.


\cataloguefield{subsection}{Definition — Proposed}

Maintain distinguishable care-episode, bounded fulfilment and delivered-activity information across performing systems.


\cataloguefield{subsection}{Intent}

Maintain the link between a bounded care request, the relevant episode and the externally observed fulfilment outcome.


\cataloguefield{subsection}{Boundary}

Encounter progression, order outcome, diagnostic interpretation, medication events and procedure documentation retain different source authorities.


\cataloguefield{subsection}{Derivation Provenance}
Inferred from bounded responsibilities and their semantic decomposition. AI architectural synthesis under the explicitly authorised Step 2 task \hyperref[evidence:4bac85accd34ce0b]{business-architecture-metamodel.md:49}; \hyperref[evidence:be61392fefb4bb10]{information-responsibility.md:10}
