Inferred from capability-specific behaviour, v0.3 inspection and current architectural evidence. AI architectural synthesis under the explicitly authorised Step 2 task \hyperref[evidence:7f4ed7644a978ab2]{task-work.md:7}; \hyperref[evidence:ea0c62dfd5edfd4a]{context-and-persistence-management.md:52}
