\cataloguefield{subsection}{Process Overview}

First inspect the governing handoff and available authoritative state; then reconcile observed effects; finally authorise a safe continuation, retry or retained uncertainty. Each participating Function keeps its responsibility owner.


\cataloguefield{subsection}{Definition — Proposed}

Order the observation, effect qualification and authorised disposition of a materially indeterminate operational outcome.


\cataloguefield{subsection}{Boundary}

Not a universal lifecycle or automatic retry loop. A safe disposition may remain unresolved.


\cataloguefield{subsection}{Proposed Placement Rationale}

Behaviour remains within Workflow \&amp; Activity Coordination responsibility.


\cataloguefield{subsection}{Derivation Provenance}
Strongly implied bounded information/work responsibility. AI architectural synthesis under the explicitly authorised Step 2 task \hyperref[evidence:d70bf9b0b197558f]{05-intrinsic-enablement.md:170}; \hyperref[evidence:ec6250f7cf7c29a5]{DesignNote-Digital-Twin-Behaviour-and-Execution-Semantics.md:73}
\cataloguefield{subsection}{Proposed Ordered Function Chain}
\nameref{function:establish-activity-effect-observation-basis} (p.\,\pageref{function:establish-activity-effect-observation-basis}) $\rightarrow$ \nameref{function:reconcile-indeterminate-activity-effects} (p.\,\pageref{function:reconcile-indeterminate-activity-effects}) $\rightarrow$ \nameref{function:determine-reconciled-activity-continuation} (p.\,\pageref{function:determine-reconciled-activity-continuation})
