Direct placement &amp; Proposed &amp; Immediate context; complete path status is separate.\\\hline
Complete structural assertion &amp; Proposed &amp; Proposed ancestry does not demote a Canonical responsibility.\\\hline
Last structural ID — historical &amp; \texttt{\seqsplit{CT1-BEC-CARE-OPERATIONS-COORDINATION-ENABLEMENT.CT2-BEC-CARE-RESOURCE-CAPACITY-COORDINATION.CT3-BEC-SERVICE-OFFERING-READINESS-COORDINATION.SV-SERVICE-OFFERING-READINESS-QUERY}} &amp; Reserved historical allocation; does not assert current placement.\\\hline
Preserved context references &amp; \nameref{cap:bec-care-operations-coordination-enablement} $\rightarrow$ \nameref{cap:bec-care-resource-capacity-coordination} $\rightarrow$ \nameref{cap:bec-service-offering-readiness-coordination} &amp; Linked responsibility references; historical records do not assert current ancestry.\\\hline
Evidence &amp; \hyperref[evidence:be61392fefb4bb10]{information-responsibility.md:34} &amp; Source standing does not approve the derived assertion.\\\hline
