\end{longtable}\endgroup
The human-reviewed reconciliation register records surviving responsibilities, scope and HUMAN ADJUDICATION REQUIRED items. Earlier Step-2 review questions are historical evidence; they do not override the reviewed hierarchy.</documentation>
