        <element xsi:type="archimate:ArchimateDiagramModel" name="Recovery Findings — mappings and identity" id="id-0a6d99cc7875565eb667d654d4dd4926">
          <child xsi:type="archimate:Note" id="id-4372bce54b9052aaa56eaa7976fa30e7" font="1|Sans|12.0|0|GTK|1|" fontColor="#000000" lineColor="#5c5c5c" textAlignment="1" fillColor="#ebf2f8">
            <bounds x="40" y="40" width="1100" height="160"/>
            <content>Recovery Findings — mappings and identity

Select this View in the model tree and open its Documentation. The frozen source or recovery findings are stored there. This note is presentation only; it creates no architectural element or relationship.</content>
          </child>
          <documentation>No pending mapping is represented by a speculative native edge. The complete machine-readable ledger accompanies the model in recovery-findings.json.

associated_feature: 120 — Feature association does not establish a particular native edge or whole-Feature realisation.
contributes_feature: 1 — Partial contribution is not whole-Feature Realization; no approved qualified edge profile.
enabled_by: 62 — Material-enablement Association profile explicitly still requires review in the mapping authority.
enterprise_contribution: 38 — Contribution strengths retain source meaning; no approved native relationship profile.
enterprise_enabled_by: 194 — Enterprise enablement does not establish native Serving or Composition; qualified profile requires review.
exposes_process: 1 — Exposure alone does not establish a process-to-Service realisation with the required direction.
governed_process: 16 — Process responsibility/governance is not automatically Assignment or Composition.
participating_function: 8 — Participation alone does not establish an ordered/whole-part process or realisation.
purpose_context: 3 — Purpose context is preserved as context; it is not decomposition.
realises_feature: 11 — Unresolved source assertion
responsibility_parent: 1 — Broader responsibility and current framing remain distinct; ownership edge profile requires review.
uses_function: 6 — Use does not establish transfer, triggering, exposed Service or native relationship direction.
uses_process: 1 — Use alone does not establish invocation, sequencing or native Serving.

Feature framing/ownership is metadata and navigation only. 214 old BC/BEC semantic objects lack a proven v0.2 crosswalk; they survive under Unreconciled 1.0.4 Reference. Application, information, technology and Motivation references without bounded typed definitions remain source documentation. No post-v0.2 corpus-register-only material is imported.</documentation>
        </element>
      </folder>
