              <documentation>Visual projection only; labels and semantic properties are inherited unchanged. Only existing Composition relationships are drawn. Features are excluded. Existing hierarchy runs left to right, with siblings stacked vertically. Entity Management, Service Administration, Service Delivery, Health Service Operations, and Intrinsic / Shared Enablement are presentation groupings, not capability tiers. This baseline provides no natural-view membership; none is inferred.</documentation>
